</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE OF CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event involving changes in the ownership or control of the borrower that may impact the credit agreement terms or obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An occurrence that leads to a transformation in the ownership or control structure of the Borrower, impacting the terms and conditions of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7.09 specifies conditions and implications if there is a change in control of the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACQUISITION INTEGRATION COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs associated with merging acquired entities into the Borrower's existing operations, essential for financial projections and assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTIEMPLOYER PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of retirement plan that involves multiple employers, potentially impacting the Borrower's liabilities and financial obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Multiemployer Plan refers to a type of employee benefit plan established through collective bargaining agreements involving multiple employers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Multiemployer Plan is defined as a multiemployer plan subject to ERISA, to which the Borrower or any Subsidiary contributes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT OF COMPETENT JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Court of Competent Jurisdiction is referred to in the context of adjudicating matters regarding the obligations and liabilities of the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal authority responsible for adjudicating disputes regarding the interpretations and applications of the Loan Document as per applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED BASIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the combined financial position and obligations of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as a singular entity for the purposes of financial analysis and reporting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SYNDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Syndication refers to the structure and arrangement of credit facilities where multiple lenders share the risk and financing responsibilities under the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW YORK BRANCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"NEW YORK BRANCH is the specific branch of DEUTSCHE BANK AG that operates in New York, facilitating local financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1dfcf35c71b9bc1649a0165fc3f3382c476139fd8e243735127e10bcebe9770</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTELESS AGREEMENT; EVIDENCE OF INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to an agreement where no physical notes are issued, signifying the evidence of the borrower's indebtedness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER ERISA LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.10 explains other liabilities related to ERISA that may influence the borrower's obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH SEVERANCE PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payments made to employees who are laid off, part of the expenses that the Borrower must account for in their financial evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal written promise to pay a specified sum of money at a designated time, which the Borrower must execute and deliver to the assignee Lender upon request."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note is a financial instrument, in the form indicated as Exhibit D, that serves as evidence of the Loans made to the Lender, reflecting amounts owed based on the terms specified."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note refers to a specific document as defined in Section 2.13(e) related to the obligations of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNING ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Issuing Lender that decides to step down from its role while retaining rights and obligations with respect to outstanding Letters of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT COMPANY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Investment Company Act defines the Borrower and its classification within investment regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Resignation Effective Date is the specific date on which the resignation of the Administrative Agent becomes effective as outlined in the notice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL ONE, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital One, National Association is a bank specializing in credit and lending services, with a commitment of $27,500,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital One, National Association is identified as a lender in the credit agreement, acting as the financial institution providing the loan to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085127d8b795687738f196be3d8bd8793e3dfdfb65449a25b2d6f47dd548c476</data>
