</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT’S CLAWBACK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provision regarding the recovery of payments by the administrative agent in certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVALIDITY OF LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.11 covers situations where the loan documents may be deemed invalid and the resulting impact on the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-RECURRING FEES AND EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"One-time costs that do not occur regularly, impacting the Borrower's financial analysis for specific periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIAIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Subsidiaries refer to the entities that are controlled by the Borrower and are considered as a whole in the context of financial conditions and operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTING OF LETTER OF CREDIT INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific process and timeline for Issuing Lenders to report their Letters of Credit to the Administrative Agent, ensuring transparency and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEAN DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Closing Date marks the formal commencement of contractual obligations and binding terms under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMOVAL EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Removal Effective Date is the date when a Defaulting Lender is removed as Administrative Agent, as communicated to the Borrower and the involved parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DANIELLE KATZ&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Danielle Katz is the duly authorized signatory representing Capital One, National Association in the execution of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-085127d8b795687738f196be3d8bd8793e3dfdfb65449a25b2d6f47dd548c476</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes the lenders that fail to meet their obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parties that fail to meet their obligations under the Agreement, particularly in relation to the issuance of Letters of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-CLOSING CHANGE OF CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.12 addresses the implications of a change of control that occurs prior to the closing of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-ORDINARY COURSE DISPOSITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a specific type of transaction mentioned in the credit agreement where Property is disposed of outside the normal course of operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lenders that have fulfilled their obligations and are entitled to receive payments during the Defaulting Lender's failure to meet its commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Non-Defaulting Lender is a lender that has complied with their obligations, maintaining their status in the lending framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advances refer to the funds provided by the Lender to the Borrower as part of the credit agreement, designated for specific uses defined within the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advances may consist of Alternate Base Rate Loans or Eurocurrency Loans, serving as different forms of borrowing under the credit arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SANCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to prohibitions that may be applied against specific individuals or entities to maintain compliance with laws, which the Borrower is responsible for adhering to in relation to funding activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sanctions refer to legal penalties imposed on the Borrower or its Subsidiaries, which can affect their ability to operate under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT’S FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fees payable to the Administrative Agent for services rendered under the Loan Documents, consistent with agreements between the Borrower and the Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DULY AUTHORIZED SIGNATORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Duly Authorized Signatory represents the party responsible for executing the agreement on behalf of the lender, ensuring that the document is legally binding."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-085127d8b795687738f196be3d8bd8793e3dfdfb65449a25b2d6f47dd548c476</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREMENTAL LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to loans that can be added incrementally under the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURVIVAL OF REPRESENTATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.01 indicates that representations made under the agreement survive beyond the closing of the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESTRUCTURING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"costs associated with reorganizing the Borrower's business structure, specifically mentioned in relation to the Spinoff process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Document refers to the formal, legally binding contract that outlines the terms and conditions related to borrowed money."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal agreement that outlines the terms, conditions, and obligations associated with loans provided under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal contract related to the loan, outlining rights, obligations, and terms agreed upon by the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal document that outlines the various terms and conditions related to the loan, including obligations of all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between the Borrower and the Lenders, including its validity and enforceability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract pertaining to the loan, outlining the terms, rights, and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract that outlines the terms and conditions, as well as the rights and obligations, involved in the loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any document related to the Loan that outlines specific terms, conditions, and obligations of the parties involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any document related to the loan transaction that defines rights, obligations, and terms between parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any document related to the loans that outlines terms and conditions relevant to the Guaranteed Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents related to the loan that outline various terms and conditions governing the credit relationship and obligations of the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents related to the loans, detailing conditions and terms under which the loan was arranged and the obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that detail the terms and conditions related to the loan, including provisions for adjustments and replacements of benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formal documents that describe the specifics of the loan, including obligations and rights of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"References to formal legal documents that outline loan terms, conditions, and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any documentation that outlines the terms and conditions of the loan, including rights and obligations of the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents that outline the terms and conditions of the loans provided, serving as formal legal agreements between the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal legal documents outlining the terms of the loan, which include the rights and obligations of the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Benchmark Replacement will replace the then-current Benchmark for all purposes hereunder and under any Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
