<node id="&quot;FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Structured credit or loan arrangement outlined in the agreement that defines the specific financing structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility refers to the structured credit or loan arrangement that details the specific financing structure and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured financial arrangement allowing Borrowers to obtain funds under specific terms and conditions agreed upon with the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured loan arrangement outlined in the agreement, specifying terms of borrowing and repayment."</data>
