</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Commitment signifies the Lender's legally binding promise to provide a specific amount of financing to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment from the Lender refers to the legally binding promise to provide financing under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment refers to the legally binding promise made by the Lenders to provide financing to the Borrower under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment defines each Lender's obligation to make Revolving Loans to the Borrower and purchase participations in L/C Obligations, within a specified aggregate principal amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment refers to the aggregate amount of the Loans which must be subject to specific minimum amounts during assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment represents the Lenders' legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legally binding promise by the lender to provide financing which is subject to specific amounts and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender's legally binding promise outlined within the Credit Agreement to provide financing to the Borrower under specified terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPENSES; INDEMNIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.06 details the responsibilities regarding expenses and indemnification of the lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFERRED REVENUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"income that has been received but not yet earned, which is noted as a point of consideration in the Borrower's Consolidated Net Income calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any taxes not defined as Indemnified Taxes, which are mentioned in relation to the lender's financial responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stamp, documentary, intangible, recording or filing taxes arising from the execution, delivery, or enforcement of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes apart from Indemnified Taxes that the Borrower must pay to the relevant Governmental Authority as part of its obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes attributable to the Lender or Issuing Lender, related to their involvement in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b3831b5841bb69061b1fe0e6df962aef02a686803822e68bc9aff48fec74e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFAULT INTEREST"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A higher interest rate applied to overdue loans when the Borrower fails to meet payment obligations under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.12&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.12 addresses tax obligations and the Borrower's responsibilities regarding timely filing and payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUIDATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Liquidator is appointed to manage the liquidation of assets in the event of a bankruptcy or insolvency proceeding involving the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RYAN DURKIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AUTHORIZED SIGNATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual identified as the authorized signatory for Goldman Sachs Bank USA, confirming the institution's representation in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual serving as the authorized signatory for Goldman Sachs Bank USA, indicating the institution's representative in contractual agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6b6ca2d4cc5d7f872dbe6f980264adf59bac19f237f2d2651238e50ce7188c0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PREPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provision allowing the borrower to repay part or all of the loan before the scheduled maturity date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCOUNTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.07 outlines the accounting requirements the borrower must adhere to under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUITY INVESTMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ownership stakes in other companies that can yield unrealized gains affecting the Borrower's financial statements, as referenced in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interest rate applied to overnight loans, varying based on currency and determined by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate at which financial institutions lend to each other overnight, referenced in the agreement for certain payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE BASE RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loans where the interest is calculated based on an alternative benchmark rate, specifically reflecting market conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.13&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.13 describes conditions related to the Borrower's status as an Affected Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEQUESTRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Sequestrator is a court-appointed official authorized to take control of assets related to claims in judicial proceedings as they impact the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUIST BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Truist Bank is a financial services institution resulting from the merger of two banks, providing various financial solutions, with a commitment of $27,500,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Truist Bank is identified as a lender in the credit agreement, responsible for providing financing to the borrower within the terms specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a79807e92594c4003f57454952f892517d7cb041b2a1bf51bd4b43ce5b6036f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH COLLATERAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets pledged by the Borrower to secure the obligations of the Issuing Lenders, particularly in relation to their Fronting Exposure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets pledged by the Borrower to secure the obligations related to Letters of Credit in the event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets provided by the borrower to mitigate risk and secure the loan amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral is required to be provided by the Borrower in connection with the Fronting Exposure of the Issuing Lenders regarding a Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral refers to assets that can be used to secure obligations related to the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral refers to the funds placed into an account by the Borrower to secure the Lenders' interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral signifies cash or deposit account balances that may be used to secure repayment obligations associated with Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash or deposit account balances pledged to the Administrative Agent as collateral for obligations under the credit agreement, ensuring security for lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash set aside to cover the obligations and potential future funding of a Defaulting Lender concerning Loans and Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds held to ensure the Defaulting Lender covers future obligations, providing security to Lenders for the payment of Loans and Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to cash or cash-equivalent assets provided to secure the loan or credit agreement obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEVERABILITY OF PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.08 states that if any provision of the agreement is found to be invalid, the remaining provisions will continue to be effective."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED LEVERAGE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ratio measuring the Borrower's Indebtedness for Borrowed Money to Consolidated EBITDA, calculated as of any date of determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior. The Consolidated Leverage Ratio must not be greater than 3.50:1.00 as of the last day of each fiscal quarter of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Participant is an entity that purchases an interest in the rights and obligations of the Lender under the Agreement, thereby entitling it to certain benefits as if it were a Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that participates in a loan under the terms set forth in the credit agreement, subject to the rights and obligations outlined within the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to an entity that has been given rights or obligations under the credit Agreement as defined in Section 12.01(d)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fees that are due and payable by the Borrower to the Lender for the availability of financing under the credit agreement, representing the cost of reserving funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligation refers to any contractual responsibilities that arise under the credit agreement, specifically those of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual duty of the Borrower to meet specific terms set out in the Loan Documents, including repayment and compliance with conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT RECIPIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity or individual that receives payments from the Administrative Agent or lenders, typically in the context of loan repayments or disbursements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Payment Recipient is the entity designated to receive payments, which may include the Borrower or other parties involved, and has certain rights and obligations concerning Erroneous Payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Payment Recipient refers to a Lender, Issuing Lender, or any person who receives funds on behalf of a Lender or Issuing Lender, excluding the Borrower or its Subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHRIS HURSEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chris Hursey is designated as the Director, acting on behalf of Truist Bank in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chris Hursey, as the individual signing on behalf of Truist Bank, carries certain obligations under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a79807e92594c4003f57454952f892517d7cb041b2a1bf51bd4b43ce5b6036f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTIFICATION OF ADVANCES, INTEREST RATES, PREPAYMENTS AND COMMITMENT REDUCTIONS; AVAILABILITY OF REVOLVING LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the process for notifying parties of various financial actions related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NONLIABILITY OF LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.09 declares that lenders are not held liable under certain conditions prescribed in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINGENT OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any agreement where a Person assumes or guarantees the obligation of another Person that constitutes Indebtedness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A record defined in Section 12.01(d) that tracks Participants involved in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A record maintained by the Administrative Agent which lists all participants involved in the credit agreement and the corresponding rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant Register is a maintained list by the Lender that includes the names and interests of all Participants in the loans, serving as a record of their investment in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.06(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.06(c) describes specific conditions under which the Lender must make payments or fulfill obligations related to the Loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL STATEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial statement that summarizes the assets, liabilities, and equity of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, required under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term referring to payments that have been received in error, which necessitate recovery processes as outlined by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Erroneous Payment is defined as a payment made in error that does not satisfy the Obligations owed by the Borrower, triggering specific rights and actions of the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Erroneous Payment refers to funds that were erroneously transmitted to or received by a Payment Recipient that must be returned to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The formal agreement outlining terms for a revolving credit facility, which allows the borrower to draw, repay, and re-borrow funds within established limits."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM AMOUNT OF EACH ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specifies the minimum amount that can be drawn by the borrower as an advance under the credit facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.10 ensures that sensitive information shared among the parties remains confidential."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTROLLED GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All members of a controlled group of corporations or other business entities under common control with the Borrower or its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Controlled Group pertains to a set of corporations or organizations that are treated as a single employer for certain benefit plan liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Controlled Group refers to any member organization that has economic ties to the Borrower or Subsidiaries and shares liabilities under pension plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Controlled Group refers to any group of entities under common control that may have liabilities concerning multiemployer plans, where the Borrower or any Subsidiary makes contributions or has obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The collective grouping of entities related to the Borrower that may share obligations under the Multiemployer Plan, relevant to withdrawal liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PBGC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PBGC means the Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation, or any successor thereto."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation, a U.S. government agency that protects retirement incomes for employees in private-sector defined benefit plans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the agreement outlining the conditions under which a Lender or Issuing Lender can seek additional compensation from the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part of the credit agreement addressing potential compensation due to tax-related matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.01 outlines specific covenants that detail the rights and responsibilities of the parties involved, ensuring adherence to the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.01 refers to provisions within the Agreement that allow a Lender to request compensation under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e62c5ad35244893d47c41c57cf2f91066b96affaf8d1e8160b7b82529c6a81d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATEMENT OF OPERATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL STATEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A report detailing the Borrower's income and expenses over a specified period, required in conjunction with the consolidated balance sheet."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An obligation by a lender or payment recipient to transfer funds as specified in the loan agreement or other related documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment refers to the process of returning funds that may have been erroneously received and must be handled in compliance with the credit terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL I&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The tier of pricing applicable to public debt ratings of ≥ BBB+ and BBB, affecting the applicable margin and commitment fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;METHOD OF PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes the procedure for how payments will be made under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NONRELIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.11 affirms that the parties do not rely on external information not contained within the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITALIZED LEASES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Leases where interest expenses are treated similarly to debt for accounting purposes, impacting financial calculations for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations of the Borrower related to lease agreements that need to be considered in the compliance calculations as specified in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWED MONEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Permitted Refinancing means, with respect to any Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DECLINING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Declining Lender is one that has failed to consent to amendments or waivers approved by Required Lenders as defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender declining to agree to a requested extension is referred to as a 'Declining Lender'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE INCOME (LOSS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL STATEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An accounting measure that includes all types of income and losses, required by the credit agreement to be reported by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities holding amounts paid to any Guarantor will hold such funds in trust for the benefit of the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trust specifies the legal obligation to manage interests and assets for the benefit of the Administrative Agent concerning erroneous payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL II&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The tier of pricing applicable to public debt ratings of BBB and BBB−, defining the associated applicable margin and commitment fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONVERSION AND CONTINUATION OF OUTSTANDING ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Details mechanisms for converting and continuing existing advances under new terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.12 mandates disclosure obligations regarding any pertinent information affecting the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Means the Bankruptcy Code of the United States, and all other liquidation, conservatorship, bankruptcy, assignment for the benefit of creditors, moratorium, rearrangement, receivership, insolvency, reorganization, or similar debtor relief laws of the United States or other applicable jurisdictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Plan means an employee benefit plan other than a Multiemployer Plan which is covered by Title IV of ERISA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a specific plan governed by ERISA, related to employee benefits and regulatory obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Assignee is referred to as the entity that receives rights and obligations under the Agreement from a Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"An assignee is a designated entity that receives the rights or obligations from a Lender following an assignment as per the conditions in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignee is an entity that may receive rights or obligations under the credit agreement through a transfer from the original party."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that receives rights and obligations through an assignment from a Lender as outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGES IN EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL STATEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the financial statements detailing any changes in the Borrower's ownership interests or reserves."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clauses in the Loan Document that outline the obligations of parties to compensate each other for certain damages or liabilities that may arise under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL III&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The tier of pricing for public debt ratings of BB+ and BB, where specific margins and commitment fees are applied."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDING INSTALLATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the locations or entities that administer the lending under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a section within the credit agreement that outlines the responsibilities and authority of the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7c5e76e9472669f1aecbca1038e883c3262d01605a6cf25e1dfa4c26db1c2183</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender that has failed to fulfill its financial obligations, impacting the rights of the Administrative Agent and other Lenders regarding setoffs and claims under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender who fails to meet its payment obligations, which may affect the decision-making process in amendments and waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a lender that has failed to meet its obligations under the agreement and may be removed from its role as Administrative Agent by the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a party that has failed to meet its obligations in relation to lending activities as specified in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender refers to a lender that has failed to meet their obligations under the loan agreement, impacting the overall lending relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that, if exists, necessitates Cash Collateralization by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that fails to fulfill its obligations under the agreement, impacting the distribution of payments among lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that has failed to fund its portion of the required Loan or funded participation as stipulated in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that has failed to meet its financial obligations under the credit agreement, affecting the pro rata share of loans and participations in letters of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that is deemed to have failed to meet its obligations under the credit agreement, which may trigger specific procedures and notifications by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender who has failed to meet their obligations under the credit agreement, impacting the distribution of credit obligations among non-defaulting lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender whose commitment is not fulfilled, resulting in their exclusion from the determination of Required Lenders in the context of the Aggregate Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defaulting Lender refers to a lender that fails to fulfill its obligations, impacting Fronting Exposure as described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that are unable to meet their obligations, which are restricted from transferring their rights or obligations through assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Means, subject to Section 2.21(g), any Lender that has failed to perform any of its funding obligations or notify the Administrative Agent in writing of issues with funding obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRO RATA SHARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each prepayment of a Revolving Borrowing shall be applied according to the Pro Rata Shares of the Lenders involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro Rata Share indicates the proportion of payments that each Lender is entitled to receive according to their respective loan amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro Rata Share means, with respect to a Lender, a portion equal to a fraction the numerator of which is such Lender’s Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro Rata Share represents the proportionate share that each L/C Participant has in the payment obligations under the Letter of Credit, determining how much each individual participant needs to contribute."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reallocation among the Lenders will be done in accordance with their revised Pro Rata Share."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pro Rata Share determines each Lender's individual share of the Aggregate Commitment and the amount they are obliged to lend to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportion of responsibility or payment each Lender agrees to cover in case of unreimbursed expenses or indemnified losses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportional allocation of amounts owed among Lenders based on their respective commitments in the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportional amount that each L/C Participant is responsible for regarding the obligations and rights under each Letter of Credit issued by the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The share of loans that each lender is entitled to receive based on their capitalization in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4612e85e877c62baf82cad7c2be4131f22c11ab0ba5b0025b887d602b61f41e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest refers to the cost associated with borrowing funds, which is to be repaid along with the principal as per the terms in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost of borrowing money expressed as a percentage, potentially subject to penalties if not paid timely under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH FLOWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL STATEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The net amount of cash being transferred into and out of the Borrower, which must be reported as part of the financial statement package required under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREPAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PREPAYMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision that allows borrowers to repay all or part of the loan before its scheduled maturity date, often with specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL IV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The pricing level associated with public debt ratings of ≤ BB and BB, outlining the applicable margin and commitment fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIBOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A key interest rate used in the pricing of Eurocurrency Loans, which has faced future cessation or loss of representativeness."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate defined for calculating the Eurocurrency Base Rate, commonly used in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate mentioned in the context of fallback provisions triggered by the Administrative Agent and Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Available Tenors of LIBOR have either permanently or indefinitely ceased to be provided by IBA."&lt;SEP&gt;"London Interbank Offered Rate, a commonly used benchmark for setting interest rates on loans that may be replaced or adjusted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mentioned in the context of replacing interest rate benchmarks, LIBOR is used as a traditional reference for determining rates in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The London Interbank Offered Rate is a benchmark interest rate that serves as the average rate at which major global banks borrow from one another in the wholesale money markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"if any Available Tenor of LIBOR does not correspond to an Available Tenor of Term SOFR, the Benchmark Replacement for such Available Tenor of LIBOR shall be the closest corresponding Available Tenor..."&lt;SEP&gt;"the definition references the then-current Benchmark other than LIBOR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to another section within the credit agreement that contains exculpatory provisions protecting certain parties from liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7c5e76e9472669f1aecbca1038e883c3262d01605a6cf25e1dfa4c26db1c2183</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loans refer to the amounts of money that are lent to the Borrower under the terms specified in the credit agreement, including conditions for repayment and interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans refer to the funds borrowed by the Borrower from the Lender under the Agreement, which are subject to repayment according to specified terms including interest rates and schedules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans refer to the funds provided by the Lenders to the Borrower, which are to be repaid according to set terms in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funding obligations related to the loans provided under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans refer to amounts made available by the Lender to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial products provided to the Borrower under the credit agreement, which must be repaid according to specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The principal amount that is outstanding from the Lenders to the Borrower, which is subject to repayment on the Existing Stated Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit arrangements made available to the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured loan arrangements detailed within the credit agreement, specifying terms under which the funds are to be disbursed and repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sum of money lent to the Borrower, mentioned in the context of repayment terms and interest calculations in case of a Default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rating system assessing the creditworthiness of borrowers that determines applicable margins and commitment fees within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Debt Rating means the public credit rating for the Borrower’s senior unsecured, long-term debt without third-party credit enhancement by S&amp;P and Fitch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Debt Ratings from S&amp;P and Fitch are used to determine the Applicable Margin or Commitment Fee in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The credit rating required for the Borrower from credit rating agencies, specifically S&amp;P and Fitch, to meet conditions for effectiveness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM COLLATERAL AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The minimum required amount of Cash Collateral to be maintained by the Borrower to secure obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum required amount of cash collateral to be maintained under the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLATFORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Platform provides the framework for electronic communication of notices and other functions related to the credit agreement, operating on an 'AS IS' and 'AS AVAILABLE' basis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Platform refers to the electronic system (DebtDomain, SyndTrak, etc.) on which Borrower Materials are posted for access by Lenders and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The technology or system used for transmitting Borrower Materials and facilitating communications among parties involved in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41989d666aefb3786ca9b5b949321066982ed454d3567c3bc79f01c213e1a860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The action of returning borrowed funds to the lender as per the terms outlined in the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL V&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pricing Level V is applied when neither S&amp;P nor Fitch has a Public Debt Rating in effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pricing level for public debt ratings of ≤ BB−, outlining the highest applicable margin and commitment fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FCPA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The FCPA relates to anti-corruption laws that the Borrower and its Subsidiaries must adhere to."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Foreign Corrupt Practices Act is referenced in the sections regarding compliance and legal obligations, highlighting its significance in governance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANKRUPTCY CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the specific set of federal laws in the United States governing bankruptcy proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. DEPARTMENT OF LABOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"U.S. Department of Labor is a federal agency responsible for enforcing the laws and regulations pertaining to labor and employee benefits, including exemptions related to prohibited transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRONTING EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to funding obligations related to participations that are required from the Borrower to the Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The risk exposure faced by the lenders issuing letters of credit, which is secured by cash collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The risk exposure that Issuing Lenders face when issuing Letters of Credit on behalf of the Borrower, which requires adequate collateralization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL AND REGULATORY REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal and Regulatory Requirements refer to the laws and standards the Borrower must comply with when using the proceeds of the Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERROR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A recognition of a mistake related to payments made, which affects the obligations of the parties involved in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;S&amp;P&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"S&amp;P provides Public Debt Ratings that influence Applicable Margins and Commitment Fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFAC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"OFAC enforces compliance and oversight related to sanctions impacting individuals and entities, including the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Office of Foreign Assets Control is mentioned within the regulatory framework that governs compliance with legal requirements in the context of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Days are defined as regular working days, excluding weekends and holidays, providing a timeline for various requests and approvals in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days defined as working days that are relevant for deadlines and obligations within the context of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which financial institutions are generally open for business, often used in determining deadlines within agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which financial institutions are open and conducting business, relevant for determining notice and payment timelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined days of operation that influence the timing related to the processing of Letter of Credit Applications and issuance requests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the days on which financial institutions are open for business and can conduct transactions, noted in the context of timing for the Rate Determination Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the defined working days relevant in the context of fulfilling obligations, particularly in relation to funding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide notices at least three to four Business Days prior to certain payments, depending on the type of advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified days that are considered operational for fulfilling obligations within the agreement, defined as days excluding weekends and holidays."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59684afb2e463574cf2aaf600c780e0debe3a298245661d942ad591b5ac883c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of lender that is involved in public finance activities and must adhere to specific compliance procedures related to securities laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined in Section 6.01, represents a financial institution or entity that provides financing to borrowers under a credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Lender is a type of Lender that may have personnel not wishing to receive material non-public information regarding the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Participation is noted as another method through which a Lender can assign rights and obligations in accordance with the provisions of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Participation refers to the share the Lender acquires in the Loans of other Lenders to ensure equitable payment sharing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.03 pertains to the notification duties of the Borrower in the event of a Default or Unmatured Default, outlining the Borrower's obligation to inform the Lenders promptly."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAUSE (A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section in the agreement detailing how erroneous payments should be handled, modifying the obligations of the parties concerning payment errors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FITCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fitch provides Public Debt Ratings that determine Applicable Margins and Commitment Fees based on their ratings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections detailing the specific promises or restrictions placed upon parties involved in the agreement to govern business practices and protect lender interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior, designed to protect the lender's interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities that provide additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to cover the loan if the primary borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantors means after the Effective Date, any Subsidiary of the Borrower that becomes a Guarantor pursuant to Section 16.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities that provide assurance to the Lenders by agreeing to fulfill the Borrower's obligations in case of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDITIONS PRECEDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are the required conditions that must be met before a Lender is obligated to fund its loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RATE MANAGEMENT TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any and all transactions related to interest rate management, including swaps and options, that are governed by specific master agreements but excluding derivative transactions embedded in convertible securities issued by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payments describe the sums that the Borrower must regularly pay under the terms of the agreement, including principal and interest amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payments refer to the amounts that are made by the Borrower to service the Loans including principal and interest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.04 details the Borrower's commitments to remain duly organized and validly existing as a corporation, partnership, LLC, or other entity, as part of its operational covenants."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any Lender may at any time assign to one or more assignees all or a portion of its rights and obligations under this Agreement and the other Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Public Debt Ratings are evaluations and classifications of credit risk from rating agencies like S&amp;P and Fitch."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPENSATION FOR LOSSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the compensation obligations for losses that may occur, establishing responsibilities and financial implications for the parties involved in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section in the agreement detailing the delegation of duties within the context of the credit arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFORMANCE OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The contractual responsibilities that the Lender must fulfill, which include funding and communication duties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A record maintained by the Administrative Agent containing details of the names and addresses of the lenders, their commitments, and amounts owing under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined in Section 12.01(c), indicating a formal record-keeping system for the transactions, entities, or agreements within the context of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Security Interest represents a legal claim on the Cash Collateral given by the Borrower to secure obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.05 mandates that the Borrower must comply with all applicable laws, rules, and regulations, establishing covenants related to legal compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Minimum Amounts refer to specific thresholds that must be met for assignments of rights and obligations under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Margin is an additional percentage considered in determining the final interest rate based on ratings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fees imposed by governmental authorities that are deducted from payments made under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial charges imposed by governmental entities, with specific clauses in the agreement addressing their treatment under indemnity provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mandatory contributions levied by governmental entities on individual or company entities, applicable to various transactions including loan payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Referenced in multiple sections, this entity includes obligations regarding tax responsibilities and implications tied to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all future taxes, imposts, and charges imposed by government authorities that may affect the financial obligations of the parties involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations that dictate how tax withholdings must be handled by the Borrower and the Administrative Agent in accordance with applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes refers to the financial charges imposed by governmental authorities that the Borrower may be obligated to handle under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section that addresses the resignation of the Administrative Agent, which is crucial in the credit agreement context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.21(G)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section of the credit agreement that outlines terms related to Defaulting Lenders and their obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to Regulation D of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, which impacts borrowing and lending practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.19&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.19 establishes the processes for sharing payments made by the Lender and adjustments relating to the Loans and interest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.06 establishes the Borrower's obligation to permit the Administrative Agent to inspect its property and records, ensuring oversight and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLEDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A pledge is mentioned as one of the methods through which a Lender may assign rights and obligations subject to restrictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT RISK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Risk is evaluated through Public Debt Ratings to assess the financial obligations and credibility of entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.23&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section in the credit agreement document that outlines definitions and terms applicable to the agreement, including maturity and termination dates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific section of the credit agreement referring to the definition and implications of a Declining Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.23 specifies terms regarding the extension of final maturity for Loans and conditions under which such extensions may occur."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.07&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section discusses the non-reliance on the Administrative Agent and other Lenders involved in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MITIGATION OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligation for the parties to mitigate losses, indicating the necessity for proactive measures to minimize potential damages related to the agreement's execution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION U&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to Regulation U of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System, governing certain aspects of credit and lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation U is a federal regulation that defines margin requirements for the extension of credit, particularly in relation to 'margin stock' and its use as collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation U pertains to the regulation of the Borrower's engagement in extending credit for margin stock."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING STATED MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existing Stated Maturity Date refers to the specified dates outlined in the agreement for loan repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Existing Stated Maturity Date is the current maturity date before any potential extensions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.07&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.07 requires the Borrower to maintain compliance with Anti-Corruption Laws and other applicable sanctions, emphasizing its legal obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATURAL PERSONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDIVIDUAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individuals, which are explicitly prohibited from receiving assignments under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount committed by all lenders in the commitment schedule amounts to $800,000,000.00, representing the aggregate commitment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ADVERSE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A significant negative impact on the financial condition or operational performance that could be relevant in the context of the Borrower's obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific promise or condition within the agreement indicating that the Borrower has not experienced any severe negative impact on its financial status or operations since a specified date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect indicates a significant change or impact that may affect the Borrower's ability to meet obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect refers to the occurrence of a situation that could negatively impact the financial standing or operational capabilities of the Borrower or its Major Subsidiaries, affecting their obligations in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect relates to a condition that could negatively impact the Borrower's financial status or ability to fulfill contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard clause under representations and warranties indicating significant negative changes that could impact the agreement's validity or execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text mentions that failure to have authority should not reasonably result in a Material Adverse Effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.08&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A part of the agreement highlighting that no other duties are imposed beyond those explicitly stated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARLY OPT-IN EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the specific date related to the Early Opt-in Election, which occurs after notice is provided to the lenders regarding changes in the benchmark rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Early Opt-in Effective Date applies to the Benchmark Replacement process under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RATE SWAP TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of Rate Management Transaction that involves exchanging cash flows based on interest rate differentials between two parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH COLLATERALIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Collateralization requires the Borrower to secure amounts to cover obligations in case a Defaulting Lender is involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of securing the obligations of the Defaulting Lender by utilizing Cash Collateral provided by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.08&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.08 specifies the maintenance obligations of the Borrower regarding Material Property and Insurance, underscoring the Borrower's responsibilities for asset management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENTS AND ASSUMPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document detailing the transfer of rights and obligations under the credit agreement from one lender to another, impacting the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;12.5000 %&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Citibank, N.A. and Barclays Bank PLC have a pro-rata share of 12.5000% of the aggregate commitment in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOLVENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition that the Borrower and its Subsidiaries are able to pay their debts and liabilities as they come due, affirming their financial stability and ability to meet obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indicator of the parties' financial standing, referenced in the context of representations and warranties to ensure both parties have the ability to meet obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.09&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section permits the Administrative Agent to file proofs of claim as necessary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARLY OPT-IN ELECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal option that allows changes to the benchmark interest rates under the credit agreement, signifying a deviation from the originally agreed terms based on evolving market conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision regarding the transition from the current benchmark rate to new rates, allowing for adjustments based on lender agreements and timing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASIS SWAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another form of Rate Management Transaction where two parties swap variable interest rate cash flows based on different bases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER'S OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the obligations of the Defaulting Lender which may require the Borrower to provide additional Cash Collateral."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Guarantor is an entity that provides additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to repay the loan if the primary borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to repay the loan if the primary Borrower defaults. Guarantors help mitigate credit risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to repay the loan if the primary borrower defaults. Guarantors help mitigate credit risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Guarantor guarantees that the Guaranteed Obligations will be paid strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document that details the terms under which one party assigns its rights and obligations under the credit agreement to another party."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;8.1250 %&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bank of America, N.A., Deutsche Bank AG New York Branch, Goldman Sachs Bank USA, Morgan Stanley Bank, N.A., and Wells Fargo Bank, National Association each have a pro-rata share of 8.1250% of the aggregate commitment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Requirement within the agreements stipulating how and when parties must inform one another of defaults or breaches, thus enhancing transparency and communication."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.10&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section related to ERISA, which may be relevant for certain financial regulations in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to any country or territory that is subject to sanctions, impacting the operations and agreements related to the lenders and borrowers involved in the credit arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT DERIVATIVE TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial agreements that transfer credit risk from one party to another, included in the categorization of Rate Management Transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Formal changes or modifications made to the existing agreement regarding obligations or terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISPOSITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TRANSACTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disposition refers to the transfer or sale of an asset or its interests as allowed or restricted by the agreement in relation to the Borrower and their subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The agreements by lenders to make letters of credit available to the borrower, ensuring bridging financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3.4375 %&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital One, National Association, HSBC Bank USA, N.A., The Bank of Nova Scotia, and Truist Bank each have a pro-rata share of 3.4375% of the aggregate commitment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLIANCE WITH LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligation for all parties to adhere to applicable laws, regulations, or guidelines under which the credit agreement operates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 11.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Discusses the mechanism of setoff under the credit agreement, addressing financial operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 11.01 establishes additional obligations that the Borrower and the Lender must comply with during the term of the Agreement to maintain good standing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISQUALIFIED STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital stock that is subject to mandatory redemption events before the defined date, affecting the conditions under which the borrower operates and relating to the overall credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Disqualified Stock refers to certain classes of stock that do not have voting rights and may impact a person's financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORWARD RATE TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rate Management Transactions that agree upon an interest rate to be paid at a future date, mitigating interest rate exposure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lenders who have fulfilled their obligations under the credit agreement and are not in default, entitled to share in any reallocation of credit obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMITTED REFINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REFINANCING OPTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Permitted Refinancing refers to the instances and conditions under which the Borrower can refinance existing Specified Indebtedness without violating agreement terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER'S OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commitments and liabilities of a Defaulting Lender that must be fulfilled to avoid penalties and maintain compliance with the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C COMMITMENT SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document describing the commitments of various lenders to provide funding under specific arrangements related to Letters of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KEEPING OF BOOKS AND RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specification outlining requirements regarding the maintenance and access to financial records and books to ensure oversight and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 12.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section that includes requirements for eligibility as an assignee under certain conditions, relevant to the rights transfer within the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outlines the provisions for successors and assigns within the credit agreement framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 12.01 contains restrictions and consents required for the assignment and delegation of rights and obligations under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
