</node>
<node id="&quot;DOLLAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal tender in the United States of America, used as a reference currency in the context of the credit agreement for all financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMODITY SWAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial arrangements allowing parties to exchange cash flows related to commodity price movements, categorized under Rate Management Transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREMENTAL REVOLVING CREDIT INCREASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific increase in the total borrower's commitment for revolving loans within the Revolving Credit Facility as requested by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incremental Revolving Credit Increase shall be effective for providing additional financing under the existing credit facilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal claim or right against the Borrower's property, used as collateral for the payment of Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, granted to the lender as security for the loan, ensuring the lender can recover its funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL RESERVE BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A central banking authority that has jurisdiction over Lenders, allowing them to pledge or assign their rights to secure obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$20,000,000.00&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total financial commitment stated for each lender in the Letter of Credit (L/C) arrangement, indicating the amount each lender is willing to provide."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal right or claim against the Borrower's asset, granted to secure the Indebtedness for Borrowed Money, ensuring lenders can recover funds if necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Clauses regarding the establishment and management of liens on assets as collateral for the obligations created under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal claims against a person's property that secure obligations under the agreement, often related to debt repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.11 discusses the legal rights or claims against a borrower's asset, which are granted to the lender as security for the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0881aebe7f897ab436dfe39a062f354ddb080e7b4c03f6cfb5f01c8a13d8ef</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 13.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Details the procedures for notices within the agreement, including effectiveness and communication methods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOLLAR EQUIVALENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dollar Equivalent refers to the amount payable in U.S. dollars that corresponds to the payment obligations outlined in the context of the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The method of evaluating amounts denominated in foreign currencies against their value in U.S. dollars based on current exchange rates, relevant for calculating obligations in different currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The value of the amount drawn under the Letter of Credit expressed in U.S. dollars for reimbursement purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4612e85e877c62baf82cad7c2be4131f22c11ab0ba5b0025b887d602b61f41e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUITY SWAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rates Management Transactions involving the exchange of cash flows based on equity index returns, helping manage exposure to equity prices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREMENTAL LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any such Person, an 'Incremental Lender', providing an Incremental Revolving Credit Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incremental Lender with an Incremental Revolving Credit Commitment shall become a Lender hereunder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are Subsidiaries providing guarantees for the Borrower's obligations under specified debt conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 12.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section within the Agreement that discusses the dissemination of information regarding the Borrower's creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the Letter of Credit, a financial instrument used in international trade to ensure payment to the beneficiary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRÉDIT AGRICOLE CORPORATE AND INVESTMENT BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A French corporate bank involved in the credit agreement, facilitating loan services and interacting with the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial institution mentioned as an Issuing Lender under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"CRÉDIT AGRICOLE CORPORATE AND INVESTMENT BANK is identified as a Lender and an Issuing Lender in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank is a financial institution engaging in corporate and investment banking, with a commitment of $100,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank serves as joint lead arrangers and joint bookrunners, coordinating aspects of the credit agreement and syndication."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing lender identified with a commitment to provide $20,000,000.00 under the Letter of Credit (L/C) arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08a18ff117104575bfd77b75ea140ea777fcfa1ebc667f328f157f3429ce2bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66fd0f9a9180e543fe5145a08d528e6028aba0d4342edd7498580d6806dc63d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-GUARANTOR SUBSIDIARY INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions regarding the borrowing capacity of subsidiaries that are not providing guarantees under the credit agreement, impacting overall risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 14.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Covers the counterpart provisions and how the agreement is made effective through documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCHANGE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL RELATED"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate used for converting currency for the purpose of loan repayments, as determined by the applicable lending entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate used to convert amounts between different currencies, determined by the Administrative Agent or Issuing Lender on specified Revaluation Dates to ensure accurate financial conversion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate used to convert one currency into another, particularly relevant for determining the Dollar Equivalent in relation to foreign currencies under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MASTER AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A comprehensive framework agreement that governs multiple transactions between parties, providing consistency and clarity on terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREASED AMOUNT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any Incremental Revolving Credit Commitments shall become effective as of such Increased Amount Date; provided that certain conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERGING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The combining of two or more entities into one, which creates a single entity and may involve transactions that require revaluation of assets and liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 12.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision in the Agreement that addresses the tax treatment of any interest in the loan documents transferred to a Participant."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Generic term used to refer to organizations like banks and lenders that provide financial services, including credit arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE LENDERS FROM TIME TO TIME PARTIES HERETO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A collective term for multiple lenders involved in the credit agreement, each providing financing under the lending terms established."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08a18ff117104575bfd77b75ea140ea777fcfa1ebc667f328f157f3429ce2bbb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL COVENANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions or targets the Borrower must meet in regard to financial metrics, which, if not met, could lead to default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.12 outlines specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0881aebe7f897ab436dfe39a062f354ddb080e7b4c03f6cfb5f01c8a13d8ef</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 15.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Discusses the choice of law governing the agreement, important for dispute resolution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REVALUATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific date on which the Borrower must assess the Exchange Rate to ensure the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure does not exceed specified limits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific date set for reevaluation of currency values for the purposes of calculating Dollar Equivalent in the context of financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Revaluation Dates are specified dates on which the value of currencies may be reassessed, impacting obligations and financial calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which valuations of Revolving Loans denominated in Foreign Currency or Letters of Credit will be assessed, including specific timeline requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the Exchange Rate is reviewed and determined for purposes of currency conversions within the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59684afb2e463574cf2aaf600c780e0debe3a298245661d942ad591b5ac883c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligations or debts that a party is responsible for under the terms of agreements, often referenced in relation to Rate Management Transactions."</data>
