</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTENSION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The proposed effective date when the Borrower requests an extension of the Stated Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date relating to the conditions under which representations and warranties are certified as true and correct."</data>
