<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another clause that defines commitments and restrictions that the borrower must follow as part of the credit agreement to safeguard the lender's interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.11 refers to a specific section of the credit agreement that discusses Liens and their implications."</data>
