</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 16.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision within the agreement that outlines the conditions under which a Subsidiary may become a Guarantor, ensuring obligations are guaranteed under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific reference within the agreement that details the conditions under which an entity may become a Guarantor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section that addresses the roles of Guarantors under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
