</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A group of lenders whose consent is required for critical decisions within the credit agreement, including waivers and amendments to the loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders constituting the minimum necessary group that must agree to the extension request."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders in the aggregate having greater than fifty percent (50%) of the Aggregate Commitment on any date of determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders whose approval is required for certain decisions related to the loans, such as determining interest rates and loan conversions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are those lenders whose consent is necessary to effect certain actions as described in the Loan Documents, playing a critical role in decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders refer to a specific group of Lenders whose consent is needed to take certain actions under the credit agreement, such as amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are a group of lenders who have the authority to appoint a successor Administrative Agent and consent to the resignation of the current Administrative Agent under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are defined as financial institutions or entities required to provide consent or approval related to the Borrower's indebtedness and obligations under the agreement, playing a critical role in determining adequate provision for payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are the financial entities necessary to provide consent or request actions by the Administrative Agent within the framework of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions that collectively have the authority to declare certain actions or penalties in the event of a default by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The written notice of objection must be from Lenders comprising the Required Lenders for the Benchmark Replacement process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
