  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section in the agreement detailing further compliance measures and terms related to debt obligations for the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific part of the credit agreement detailing the financial covenants and ratios required of the Borrower, including adjustments in case of Material Acquisitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.12 refers to a specific section of the credit agreement that focuses on Financial Covenants and their requirements."</data>
