<node id="&quot;SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark rate that may include SOFR, a term SOFR, or any other rate based upon SOFR as referenced in the context of Dollar-denominated syndicated credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The secured overnight financing rate published by the Federal Reserve Bank of New York, used as a benchmark for financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
