</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CITIBANK, N.A. acts as the Administrative Agent, a Lender, and an Issuing Lender in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. is a financial institution providing loans and financing services, with a commitment of $100,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. is acting as the administrative agent and an issuing lender, facilitating the loan process and managing the agreement on behalf of the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. is designated as the Administrative Agent and an Issuing Lender in the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing lender identified with a commitment to provide $20,000,000.00 under the Letter of Credit (L/C) arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b07eaf1cd11ad2db2417fe6ba87a7a0eb64930b9f015b722b79b572a77fc318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08a18ff117104575bfd77b75ea140ea777fcfa1ebc667f328f157f3429ce2bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
