<node id="&quot;FOREIGN CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any currency other than U.S. Dollars that may be used for disbursements and payments under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the domestic currency, used as a reference for certain transactions outlined in the Letter of Credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency that is not Dollars, referenced for purposes of determining amounts related to Loans and Letter of Credit obligations in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Currency other than US dollars that may be used under certain terms of the credit agreement for repayments or loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign Currency denotes any currency other than Dollars that the Borrower may select for the purpose of making payments under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign Currency refers to currencies other than Dollars that can be used for Eurocurrency Loans, subject to specific approvals as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign Currency refers to currencies other than the primary currency, indicating that Eurocurrency Loans can be denominated in various currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign Currency signifies any currency other than the domestic currency of the Borrower, which is relevant for the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to currencies other than the Borrower's domestic currency, impacting the costs of loans and operations within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to syndicated credit facilities that include Foreign Currency, as mentioned in the notification by the Administrative Agent and Borrower about interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various currencies accepted under the agreement for credit transactions and repayment schedules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59684afb2e463574cf2aaf600c780e0debe3a298245661d942ad591b5ac883c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BARCLAYS BANK PLC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution involved as an Issuing Lender that provides letters of credit under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A key lending institution mentioned in the agreement, noted for its role in financial transactions and fee arrangements between the borrower and the bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"BARCLAYS BANK PLC is identified in the text as both a Lender and an Issuing Lender, indicating its role in providing financing under the terms of a credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barclays Bank PLC is a financial institution offering banking services, with a commitment of $100,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barclays Bank PLC is listed as one of the lenders under the credit agreement, providing financing and support as part of the lending group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing lender identified with a commitment to provide $20,000,000.00 under the Letter of Credit (L/C) arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8874bcc7c3e8d2a0bd2c4ddb978146909c720459243d4ef3416f7f984f6e431&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08a18ff117104575bfd77b75ea140ea777fcfa1ebc667f328f157f3429ce2bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
