<node id="&quot;WAIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Decisions made to relinquish certain rights or claims under the agreement, affecting obligations or performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.04 discusses waivers, which are formal decisions allowing a party to relinquish known rights or claims under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50114c97c504fe761ee5bf9ff61f7df5fb6293aa48c05ebc7774d30c0ccc835e</data>
