  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the agreement detailing provisions related to changes in capital adequacy and reimbursement processes for the Lender and Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part of the credit agreement regarding additional payment requirements to Lenders."</data>
