<node id="&quot;GXO LOGISTICS, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"GXO LOGISTICS, INC. is a legal business entity that has executed the credit agreement with the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"GXO Logistics, Inc. is a Delaware corporation identified as the Borrower in the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"GXO Logistics, Inc. is identified as the borrower within the credit agreement, responsible for receiving funds and complying with the terms outlined in the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower listed in the document is GXO Logistics, Inc., based in Greenwich, CT, providing their address and attention to Baris Oran for notices."</data>
