<node id="&quot;CONTINUING GUARANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 16.05 details a continuing guaranty, which provides ongoing assurance to the lender regarding the obligations of the borrower."</data>
