</node>
<node id="&quot;CDOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another reference interest rate tied to fallback provisions mentioned alongside LIBOR in the context of syndicated credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, another benchmark rate referenced in loan agreements that might undergo replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Dealer Offered Rate is the average rate at which Canadian banks are willing to lend to one another for short-term funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, a benchmark used for interest calculations on Eurocurrency Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20</data>
