</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities associated with the Administrative Agent that may provide additional assurance to the Lender regarding the Borrower's obligations under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities related to the Administrative Agent and Lenders that may hold rights under the agreement per the outlined sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the Borrower's Affiliates, controlling Persons, successors and assigns, and the advisors of the aforementioned parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties refer to entities that have a close association with the Administrative Agent or any Lender, involved in the credit agreement process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties refer to parties connected to the Administrative Agent, including affiliates and sub-agents, that assist in the administration of the loan documents and compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
