</node>
<node id="&quot;REPORTABLE EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Reportable Event signifies a specific occurrence related to financial or operational changes within the Borrower or its plans, which must be reported and might necessitate amendments to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined occurrence under Section 4043 of ERISA that necessitates reporting, excluding those waived by the PBGC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e</data>
