<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A designation for any Person that meets specific criteria to be an assignee under Section 12.01(b)(v), (vi), and (vii) of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Eligible Assignee is defined as a potential recipient of assigned rights and obligations, subject to conditions outlined in the agreement."</data>
