</node>
<node id="&quot;JOINT LEAD ARRANGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The entities acting as joint lead arrangers, including Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank, responsible for coordinating and structuring the syndication of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08a18ff117104575bfd77b75ea140ea777fcfa1ebc667f328f157f3429ce2bbb</data>
