<node id="&quot;FAILURE TO MAKE PAYMENTS WHEN DUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.02 outlines the obligations and repercussions if the borrower fails to make timely payments as stipulated in the credit agreement."</data>
