</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 16.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific part of the agreement outlining the absolute nature of the Guarantor's obligations and various conditions under which they operate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.03 outlines the terms and conditions of the Guaranty Absolute within the credit agreement framework."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50114c97c504fe761ee5bf9ff61f7df5fb6293aa48c05ebc7774d30c0ccc835e</data>
