  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A part of the agreement detailing the waivers related to the Guarantor's obligations, including the absence of prompts for payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.04 specifies the conditions for waivers, which allow parties to forego certain rights under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50114c97c504fe761ee5bf9ff61f7df5fb6293aa48c05ebc7774d30c0ccc835e</data>
