<node id="&quot;CREDIT EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal request mechanism that details the terms for extending credit facilities including Revolving Borrowing and Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit Extension refers to a formal request made by the Borrower for additional financing under the credit agreement, contingent upon satisfying certain conditions."</data>
