<node id="&quot;PENALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charges that may apply in case of failure to comply with tax obligations, which the Borrower may also need to indemnify."&lt;SEP&gt;"Penalties imply any financial consequences imposed on the Borrower for failing to meet obligations or standards established in the credit agreement."</data>
