  <data key="d1">"A public administrative authority or person entrusted with such authority in an EEA Member Country responsible for the resolution of any EEA Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"An administrative authority with powers to manage crisis situations for financial institutions within the European Economic Area."&lt;SEP&gt;"An authority within the European Economic Area responsible for managing financial institution crises and ensuring compliance with financial regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20</data>
