  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Barclays Bank PLC and Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank acting as syndication agents for the Lenders in connection with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities serving as co-syndication agents to facilitate the loan agreement - specifically referring to Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank and Barclays Bank PLC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that assist in the syndication of loans, working alongside Lenders and the Borrower."</data>
