<node id="&quot;SECTION 16.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section in the agreement that states the nature of the Guarantee as a continuing obligation until all Guaranteed Obligations are fully settled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.05 pertains to the Continuing Guaranty, detailing the ongoing obligations of guarantors to maintain their responsibilities under the credit agreement."</data>
