</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws that impact financial institutions included in the credit arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority responsible for ensuring the compliance and governance of financial institutions, particularly in the event of financial distress or insolvency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937</data>
