<node id="&quot;SECTION 16.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section specifying the conditions under which a Guarantor may be released from obligations based on compliance with the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.06 deals with the Release of Guarantors, indicating how and when guarantors can be formally released from their obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 16.06 outlines specific requirements the Borrower must satisfy regarding the release of documents and other obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50114c97c504fe761ee5bf9ff61f7df5fb6293aa48c05ebc7774d30c0ccc835e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b934ac68df115101e3934d25b36c1f0d39ba84bedc9d3bfa855b63fe2cc20e3</data>
