  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to any and all federal, state, local, and foreign statutes, laws, and regulations relevant to the environmental responsibilities of financial institutions or agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE OUTSTANDING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure represents the total amount of credit that has been extended to the Borrower and is currently outstanding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sum of the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure shall not exceed the Aggregate Commitments as per the requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit extended that the Borrower must manage to remain under the Aggregate Commitment limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of outstanding credit that Lenders hold, which influences the determination of Required Lenders if the Aggregate Commitment is terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of outstanding credit that the Borrower has with respect to the Letters of Credit, which is regulated as per the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
