<node id="&quot;FACILITY TERMINATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the earliest date when a credit facility may be terminated, contingent on various conditions outlined in the agreement, including the satisfaction of specific criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specifies the date on which the facility under the credit agreement will terminate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Termination Date is the date that signifies the end of a facility agreement as it applies to any Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Termination Date is the specified date when all obligations under the credit facility must be fulfilled by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Facility Termination Date signifies the final due date of the credit facility, by which all obligations and repayments are required to be settled."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the credit facility ceases to be available for drawing, marking the end of the lending arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the facility is terminated, and repayments, including fees, must be settled."&lt;SEP&gt;"The final date by which the facility agreement will terminate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The last date on which the facility or loan agreement may be active, indicated by the conclusion of the Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The last date on which the facility or loan agreement remains effective or the loan must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined date by which all obligations under the loan must be fulfilled and signifies the end of the loan term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final date indicating the conclusion of the terms of the Revolving Credit Facility agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, at which all outstanding loans and unpaid obligations must be paid in full by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date marking the end of obligations related to the Letter of Credit, after which no Issuing Lender is obligated to issue any Letters of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVOLUNTARY BANKRUPTCY; APPOINTMENT OF RECEIVER; ETC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.06 addresses instances where an involuntary bankruptcy occurs or a receiver is appointed against the borrower."</data>
