</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLIANCE CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document provided by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent, indicating compliance with the financial covenants specified in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit A – Form of Compliance Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
