</node>
<node id="&quot;FORM W-9&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document required by the Internal Revenue Service in the U.S. to certify the tax status of the Lender, which allows the Borrower and Administrative Agent to determine tax obligations."</data>
