</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These terms detail the responsibilities and rights transferred in the context of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e40a6ce74fe978e7cab7bc4b2d776d5500985fc28b4f39192e445d1dae7277ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE TEAM MAIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEPARTMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A team tasked with financial reporting at Citibank Delaware, handling disclosures for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eccf723d1fbcf7a1e873e53d43c3e496564076ea5d13971d680c78003cea4353</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Environmental Liability means any liability, contingent or otherwise (including any liability for damages, cost of environmental remediation, fines, penalties or indemnities), resulting from or based upon (a) violation of any Environmental Law, (b) the generation, use, handling, transportation, storage, treatment or disposal of any Hazardous Materials, (c) exposure to any Hazardous Materials, (d) the release or threatened release of any Hazardous Materials into the environment or (e) any contract, agreement or other consensual arrangement pursuant to which liability is assumed or imposed with respect to any of the foregoing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities associated with environmental issues, potentially affecting the Borrower or its Subsidiaries under the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TYPES OF ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes different forms of advances that can be drawn under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 7.07 discusses the ramifications of judgments against the borrower that could affect their financial commitments under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal agreement for an assignment entered into by a Lender and an Eligible Assignee, which must receive consent from any party as required."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit B – Form of Assignment and Assumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignment and Assumption involves the transfer of rights and obligations in the context of the Loan, as accepted by the involved parties according to the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document that parties to each assignment must execute and deliver to the Administrative Agent, detailing the rights and obligations assigned from one Lender to another."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUISITE AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specifically defined amount, in this case $100,000,000, which is referenced in the context of borrowing amounts under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum principal amount that triggers specific obligations under the agreements or instruments relating to Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNITED STATES PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual or entity defined under U.S. tax law as having a specific relationship to the United States, impacting how taxes apply to transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAJOR SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Major Subsidiaries are identified as significant affiliated entities of the Borrower that may share responsibility for the obligations stated in the credit agreement and are affected by the Borrower's financial conditions and actions as described in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOROUGH OF MANHATTAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"JURISDICTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All judicial proceedings brought by the borrower related to any loan document shall be conducted only in courts located in the BOROUGH OF MANHATTAN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BOROUGH OF MANHATTAN is referred to as the jurisdiction where any federal court of the United States of America is sitting, along with state courts for legal proceedings related to loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The agents, issuing lenders, and lenders irrevocably submit to the jurisdiction of the courts in the BOROUGH OF MANHATTAN for any actions related to loan documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49b949bd6b938010a265fb14a53b068d725f73af78772772e2b7ee398ddb3783</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENCYABTFSUPPORT@CITI.COM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION CHANNEL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Email address provided for support related to borrower inquiries at Citibank Delaware."</data>
