</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Details regarding the rates of interest applicable to the advances made under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage charged by the Lender for borrowed funds, applicable both to Eurocurrency Loans and other types of financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-285be243c5ad90acd795b6efd3e10813f6b0fc81e87f36039e9517d2db3b1860</data>
