</node>
<node id="&quot;UNFUNDED LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liabilities that exceed the value of plan assets, indicating a financial obligation for the institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 7.08 covers liabilities that have not yet been funded but may impact the borrower's financial standing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unfunded Liabilities pertain to the financial obligations that the Borrower and its Major Subsidiaries need to address regarding their pension plans and other liabilities that could impact their overall financial standing under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8d309f90236c63cbdbe99963429949cf52b941a2898e25ca92a5c31865b6e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
