</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. FEDERAL INCOME TAX PURPOSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The application of U.S. federal tax laws as they pertain to income earned by individuals and entities within the jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6</data>
