</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution acting in the capacity of Issuing Lender, except when also acting as the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial institution involved as an Issuing Lender that provides letters of credit under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specified financial institution involved in transactions associated with the facilities, recognized as a lender in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank is the financial institution appointed as the Administrative Agent, responsible for acting on behalf of the Lenders in managing and administering the credit agreement and loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank means Citibank, N.A., in its individual capacity, and its successors, serving as the lender providing financing under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank serves as the contractual representative of the Lenders in its capacity as the Administrative Agent pursuant to Article 10 of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SYNDICATED CREDIT FACILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"refers to loans provided collectively by a group of lenders, often coordinated by an agent, to share the risks and financial responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE RETIREMENT INCOME SECURITY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"ERISA means the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended from time to time, including (unless the context otherwise requires) the rules or regulations promulgated thereunder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UK RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority that oversees the compliance and management of financial institutions based in the United Kingdom, especially in crisis situations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERNAL REVENUE SERVICE FORM W-8BEN&quot;">
