<node id="&quot;BORROWING NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Borrowing Notice is a formal notification required from the Borrower detailing the specifics of the Advance to be drawn."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notice from the Borrower to the Lender requesting the disbursement of funds under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notification from the Borrower indicating the request for a loan, which specifies the amount to be borrowed for reimbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notification that indicates a request or intent to borrow funds under the terms of a credit agreement, particularly for a Revolving Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined as per Section 2.08 of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit E – Form of Borrowing Notice."</data>
