</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Benchmark Transition Event triggers the replacement of the then-current Benchmark without further consent from the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"the occurrence of one or more of the following events that signify a transition in the Benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb</data>
