</node>
<node id="&quot;HAZARDOUS MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hazardous Materials includes various substances regulated under Environmental Law, which may impact borrowing parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hazardous Materials refers to any substance that poses a risk to health or the environment, including those involved in the generation, handling, or disposal processes that could lead to liabilities under environmental laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
