<node id="&quot;CONVERSION/CONTINUATION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal communication that indicates a request for the conversion or continuation of an existing loan within the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit F – Form of Conversion/Continuation Notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower shall give the Administrative Agent notice substantially in the form of Exhibit F (a 'Conversion/Continuation Notice') or such other form as may be approved by the Administrative Agent."</data>
