<node id="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A disbursement of funds by the Lender to the Borrower, facilitated by the Administrative Agent as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions. In this context, it relates to the use of proceeds for various purposes defined by the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advance relates to the specific disbursement of funds provided to the Borrower by the Lender under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the funds that the Borrower can draw under various conditions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a form of borrowing, specifically categorized as a Revolving Borrowing under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the amounts disbursed by the lender to the borrower, which are subject to the terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money disbursed to the Borrower by the Lender under the terms of the credit agreement, which must be repaid with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"the amount of money received by the Borrower under the terms of this loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
