<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used for calculating the interest due on loans within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Eurocurrency Rate refers to the interest rate for a Eurocurrency Advance, calculated based on the Eurocurrency Base Rate relevant for the interest period, adjusted for reserve requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The reference interest rate applicable to Eurocurrency Loans, influencing interest rates charged by the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
