</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS FOR BORROWED MONEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial obligation incurred by a borrower, which typically involves repaying borrowed funds, often secured by liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial obligation incurred by the Borrower, which may involve secured loans and is subject to certain covenants regarding the ratio of leverage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party's obligations to repay borrowed funds, which may create various obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Describes the debt obligations incurred by the Borrower and includes various forms of financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness for Borrowed Money outlines the principal amount and obligations related to borrowed funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness for Borrowed Money refers to the financial obligations the Borrower has incurred, which include loans and other borrowings, as outlined in the credit agreement and related to the terms of repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations related to borrowing that the Borrower and its Subsidiaries must satisfy, as outlined in the definitive documentation of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of debt that the borrower owes under the terms specified in the agreement for funds borrowed from various lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to all financial obligations the Borrower or its subsidiaries may owe, defined under the scope of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrowing Date is the specific date when the Borrower requests additional funds as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowing Date is the specific date upon which the Borrower requests the disbursement of the loan under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"means a date on which an Advance is made or a Letter of Credit is issued hereunder."</data>
