  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the specific date that is two business days prior to the first day of an Interest Period, used for determining the interest rate applicable during that period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Rate Determination Date is the specific date on which the interest rates, such as LIBOR or EURIBOR, are set for the interest calculations."</data>
