  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, which oversees securities transactions and compliance related to financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, which oversees the securities industry, ensuring that the Borrower complies with regulatory reporting standards."</data>
