<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A detailed outline of the commitments made by different lenders in relation to the L/C, specifying the amounts and terms associated with each lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment Schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Document detailing commitments made by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment Schedule outlines each Lender’s Commitment and Issuing Lender’s L/C Commitment as of the Effective Date, attached as a schedule in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commitment schedule outlines the commitments and pro-rata shares of various lenders in the credit agreement, totaling $800,000,000.00."</data>
