<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Affiliate refers to any related entity to the Lender or Issuing Lender that may have financial interactions or responsibilities concerning the Borrower and the Loan Documents, especially in the context of setoffs."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that is controlled by, controls, or is under common control with another Person, affecting obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities affiliated with a Lender, which may receive certain assignments without needing prior consent from the Borrower, as outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee</data>
