  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certain taxes that are explicitly excluded from the lender's obligations as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes imposed on payments to the Administrative Agent, any Lender, or other recipients under specific conditions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not considered as part of Indemnified Taxes, thus excluding the Borrower from certain obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not indemnified by the Borrower and may be applicable to the Lender or Issuing Lender under the credit agreement."</data>
