  <data key="d1">"A financial institution located in the European Economic Area, impacting the Borrower's agreements and commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any credit institution or investment firm established in any EEA Member Country which is subject to the supervision of an EEA Resolution Authority or any entity that is a parent or subsidiary of such financial institution."</data>
