<node id="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LETTER OF CREDIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Letter of Credit is a financial instrument guaranteed by the Administrative Agent on behalf of the Borrower to ensure payment to a beneficiary, fulfilling obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Letter of Credit is a financial instrument issued by an Issuing Lender guaranteeing payment on behalf of the Borrower to a beneficiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Letter of Credit is a financial instrument issued by the Lender guaranteeing payment on behalf of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by a bank guaranteeing payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary as part of the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by a bank guaranteeing payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary, ensuring that the borrower's obligations will be met even if they encounter financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by a bank guaranteeing payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary, ensuring that the borrower's obligations will be met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by a bank guaranteeing payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary, ensuring that the borrowers obligations will be met even if they encounter financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by a bank guaranteeing payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary. This ensures that the borrower's obligations will be met even if they encounter financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by the Issuing Lender guaranteeing payment on behalf of the Borrower to a beneficiary, ensuring that the Borrower's obligations will be met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by the Issuing Lender to provide payment guarantees on behalf of the Borrower to a beneficiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument issued by the Issuing Lender which guarantees payment to a beneficiary, ensuring that the Borrower's obligations will be met even if they encounter financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument referenced that guarantees payment for the borrower under specified conditions and amounts. It is subject to automatic increases based on the terms of the applicable Letter of Credit or Letter of Credit Application."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial instrument that guarantees payment on behalf of the borrower to a beneficiary, ensuring that the borrower's obligations will be met even if they encounter financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"a financial guarantee issued on behalf of the Borrower to ensure payment to a beneficiary under specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4612e85e877c62baf82cad7c2be4131f22c11ab0ba5b0025b887d602b61f41e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A referenced document within the agreement pertaining to the conditions and definitions of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302</data>
