</node>
<node id="&quot;SAME DAY FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funds that are immediately available for disbursements and payments in specified currencies as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that are required to be available for immediate payment on the same day, as stipulated in the payment terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
