</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indemnity Payments refer to the compensation the Borrower must provide to the Administrative Agent or Lender for costs incurred related to Taxes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
