</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities that may participate in the loan arrangement, potentially holding rights or obligations assigned from the original lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Participants are those who may be involved in the credit agreement and may receive defined rights or obligations under its terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad</data>
