</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A designated entity, often a bank or financial intermediary, tasked with managing the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement, including fund disbursement, communication, and coordination among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any of the Administrative Agent, the Arrangers or the Co-Syndication Agents involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial intermediary responsible for managing and coordinating the administrative aspects of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER’S REGISTRATION STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"a document that includes necessary disclosures and financial data regarding the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDING INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An establishment or location from which Lenders and Issuing Lenders operate, affecting how capital requirements are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lending Installation refers to the physical or operational set-up through which the Lender provides funds or loans to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The physical or legal location where loans are booked by the Lender, which can vary depending on the Lender's operational choices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific location designated for the disbursement of loans by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific office or branch of a Lender or Agent where the lending activities related to the agreement are managed or conducted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e62c5ad35244893d47c41c57cf2f91066b96affaf8d1e8160b7b82529c6a81d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SANCTION(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Economic or financial sanctions imposed by various government bodies that may impact the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional Amounts are payments the Borrower may need to make to cover specific costs related to withholding or taxes under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section of the agreement that outlines survival terms for representations and warranties made in the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRAUDULENT TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a type of transfer of assets or rights that can be challenged in bankruptcy law, particularly when it seems designed to avoid creditors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT A&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A compliance certificate format required under the credit agreement, demonstrating the borrower's compliance with financial covenants and detailing any defaults or issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of Compliance Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Aggregate Commitment refers to the total amount of commitments currently held by lenders in relation to the borrowing arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Aggregate Commitment refers to the total amount of financing that Lenders are collectively willing to provide to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Aggregate Commitment refers to the total amount that the Lenders agree to provide to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount that must not be exceeded when the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure is calculated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount committed by lenders to be available for borrowing under the terms specified, which is used to determine the Required Lenders on a given date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of all Lenders’ commitments, set at Eight Hundred Million Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of commitment available from all Lenders in a syndicate under the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of financing that the lender is legally obliged to make available to the borrower, under specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that all Lenders have agreed to provide in the Revolving Credit Facility, determining individual Lender obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">""The requested date, which shall be a Business Day, of such conversion or continuation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day refers to any day that is not a weekend or a holiday, which dictates the timing of payments and obligations as specified in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which business is conducted, specifically mentioned as the timeframe for transactions with the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined operational day in which business is conducted, affecting timelines within the credit agreement such as the Maturity Date clauses."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific day when business transactions can be conducted, excluding weekends and holidays, pertinent in the context of payment notifications and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any day that is not a Saturday, Sunday, or public holiday, in which the operations of the financial institutions are open and normal banking activities can be conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day denotes any day on which normal business activities are conducted, affecting the timing of notice deliveries and communications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a day when banks are open in New York for conducting commercial activities, impacting Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard working days defined in the agreement, which are significant for issuing Letters of Credit and other transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific weekdays on which financial transactions can occur as per banking standards, excluding weekends and public holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified days during which business transactions are conducted, playing a vital role in determining deadlines for actions by the Borrower and Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4612e85e877c62baf82cad7c2be4131f22c11ab0ba5b0025b887d602b61f41e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41989d666aefb3786ca9b5b949321066982ed454d3567c3bc79f01c213e1a860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.05(E)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific provisions within the agreement that govern the conduct of the Lender regarding withholding taxes and compliance."</data>
