  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBJECT RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PARTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities closely related to a person, including controlling persons, directors, and employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFUND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refund refers to the amount returned to the Borrower from any overpayment or tax excess collected from the Borrower under specified conditions in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision in the agreement addressing governmental regulation and restrictions on extending credit to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. BANKRUPTCY CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL REFERENCE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The federal law governing bankruptcy proceedings in the United States, including provisions related to fraudulent transfers and the rights of creditors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT B&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific form referenced for the assignment and assumption agreement between parties in the credit context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of Assignment and Assumption."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Date on which the Agreement takes effect, signifying when the contractual obligations begin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial statements were delivered prior to the Effective Date to the Arrangers and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date marks the commencement of the credit agreement, established when all conditions precedent must be satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date marks the specific date when the credit agreement becomes legally binding and the obligations commence for all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date refers to the date on which the terms of the Agreement become binding on all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date signifies the start of the credit agreement, marking when the terms become operational and enforceable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which all conditions precedent must be satisfied or waived for the agreement to take effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the agreement's terms begin to take effect, often highlighting the start of related commitments and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which all conditions specified in Section 4.01 shall first be satisfied or waived, marking the formal commencement of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which all parties have signed the agreement, marking the formal commencement of contractual obligations and binding terms related to obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which all parties have signed the agreement, marking the formal commencement of contractual obligations and binding terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the agreement becomes effective and binding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the credit agreement and associated obligations commence, referenced in the document as a notion of timing for various covenants and commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the agreement becomes legally binding upon all parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eeec26f077adfdd1561d685690da4017d74add9d0d6ff1b455ea904bd15cd20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A loan denominated in a currency that is typically traded in the Eurocurrency market, including loans in Dollars, Euros, and Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan that is denominated in a currency outside of its domestic market, generally subject to specific terms and conditions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan linked to Eurocurrency rates, which allows the Borrower to borrow in various foreign currencies as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that involves international currency transactions, subject to specific interest rate determinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Advance or 'Eurocurrency Loan' means an Advance or Loan which, except as otherwise provided in Section 2.11, bears interest based on the applicable Eurocurrency Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
