  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the date defined within the document concerning the 'Facility Termination Date'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Stated Maturity Date is the due date for the repayment of the loan, which may be extended upon agreement."</data>
