<node id="&quot;FATCA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FATCA refers to laws that govern the withholding and deduction processes required by the Borrower or the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Law governing U.S. tax compliance, particularly concerning withholding taxes applicable to foreign entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act is referenced in the agreement, detailing regulations related to tax compliance and lender obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7</data>
