  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate used for loans, it influences the rate charged on Alternate Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate publicly announced by Citibank which serves as a reference point for pricing certain loans."</data>
