<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause stating that obligations of Lenders and Issuing Lenders are several, meaning each is independently accountable for their commitments under the agreement."</data>
