<node id="&quot;ARRANGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Citibank, N.A., Barclays Bank PLC, and Crédit Agricole, Corporate and Investment Bank serving as Joint Lead Arrangers in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities involved in arranging the credit agreement, managing the coordination and structuring of the loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial entities involved in arranging the credit agreement and facilitating the loan transactions between the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties involved in structuring the credit agreement and coordinating between the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arrangers are designated entities involved in coordinating the lending process and facilitating relationships among the Borrower, Lenders, and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arrangers are entities involved in the structuring and arrangement of the credit facilities, facilitating communication among lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower delivered financial statements to the Arrangers and the Lenders prior to the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of borrowing arrangement involving loans denominated in currencies such as Dollars, Euros, and Canadian Dollars which are generally utilized in international finance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GXO DISTRIBUTION CONDITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific condition related to the distribution of assets or obligations that affects the ownership status of the Borrower in relation to XPO Logistics, Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific condition that must be fulfilled prior to the Facility Termination Date, indicating operational or financial criteria needed for loan continuation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defines specific conditions related to the GXO distributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"GXO Distribution Condition shall be satisfied if the distribution of all shares of common stock of the Borrower to the shareholders of XPO Logistics, Inc. (the Spinoff) shall have been consummated in a manner substantially consistent in all material respects with the description thereof in the Borrower Form 10."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK OF ENGLAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The central bank of the United Kingdom responsible for the monetary policy and financial stability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CIRCUMSTANTIAL CHANGE NOTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Circumstantial Change Notification denotes the obligation of Lenders or Issuing Lenders to inform the Borrower of any significant changes affecting financial arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party that may be indemnified against any claims or damages in accordance with the provisions of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party entitled to compensation or indemnity related to losses or claims as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party that is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms of the agreement, including indemnity obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd</data>
