</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A contractual obligation made by a Guarantor to assume responsibility for repaying the Borrower's obligations if they default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal agreement wherein a Guarantor commits to fulfill the obligations of the Borrower should they default on their payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
