</node>
<node id="&quot;OUTSTANDING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Outstanding Credit Exposure indicates the remaining amount of credit extended by lenders that has not yet been repaid by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit exposure that remains outstanding with respect to all Lenders at any given time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total principal amount and obligations of the Lender outstanding at a given time under the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the total amount that the Borrower currently owes to the lenders, impacting the Aggregate Commitment calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOLLARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dollars refer to the primary currency used for Eurocurrency Loans, indicating that these loans may be denominated in a specific currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the lawful currency of the United States, commonly used in international transactions and Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The denomination used for cash collateralization and other financial transactions within the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
