</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount of commitments that a Lender and its Affiliates hold under the Agreement, which has a restriction on exceeding 30% without Borrower consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of financial commitments made by the lenders available to the Borrower under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of financing that the Lender is committed to providing to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that lenders are committed to lend, which must not be exceeded by the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total commitments made by lenders in a shared credit agreement, which can dictate the termination or modifications of the facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total obligations under which the Borrower must perform, as referenced in the section discussing the survival of obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. PATRIOT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A U.S. law aimed at combating terrorism by enhancing law enforcement's investigative tools and capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A regulatory framework that requires the Borrower to provide certain documentation and information to satisfy compliance requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Act under which Lenders are required to obtain and verify the identity of the Borrower as part of legal and due diligence obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
