</node>
<node id="&quot;LESS FAVORABLE NET AFTER-TAX POSITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Less Favorable Net After-Tax Position describes a financial situation where indemnified parties could incur losses due to tax deductions, which the Borrower must avoid through proper measures."</data>
