<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Principal refers to the original sum of money borrowed by the Borrower under the credit agreement before any interest or fees are added."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original amount of money borrowed or the original amount of a loan that must be repaid, excluding interest."</data>
