  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Baris Oran is the Chief Financial Officer for GXO LOGISTICS, INC., and has signed the agreement, indicating his role in the execution of the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baris Oran is the point of contact for notices related to GXO Logistics, Inc., as specified in the address of the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Baris Oran, serving as Chief Financial Officer, represents the corporation and has signed the agreement on behalf of GXO LOGISTICS, INC."</data>
