<node id="&quot;ALTERNATE BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fluctuating interest rate used for determining repayment terms on loans denominated in Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used to calculate the payments due from the Borrower when a Default occurs, indicating an increase in interest rates."</data>
