<node id="&quot;GAAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial statements must be prepared in accordance with GAAP, as referenced in the Borrower's documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP) govern the accounting practices, which the Borrower and its Subsidiaries must adhere to when preparing financial reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles that dictate how leasing obligations are accounted for in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the accounting standards that the borrower and its subsidiaries must follow when preparing financial statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the framework of accounting standards, principles, and procedures that Borrower must adhere to in financial reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the standard framework of guidelines used for financial reporting in the United States."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
