<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A referenced section in the agreement that details conditions under which the Aggregate Commitment may be terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific clause detailing the right of Lenders to receive Commitment Fees based on their participation in the credit facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRA RULEBOOK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A set of regulations established by the Prudential Regulation Authority that governs financial institutions in the UK."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
