</node>
<node id="&quot;WITHHOLDING TAX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Withholding Tax refers to the systematic deduction of taxes from payments that the Borrower may have to manage under specific legal frameworks mentioned in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
