</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal decision by the Borrower to relinquish its responsibility for certain losses or claims as outlined in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"POSITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chief Financial Officer is the title held by Baris Oran, who represents the corporation in the execution of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d81b9e1363c8d74a9928616039bf898a4e320084199374c175400dc46c844593</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT H-3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another form referenced for tax compliance certificate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of U.S. Tax Compliance Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b8be7665ef2349c16560bc44e858be4f2a2e3bba9133bd6003bb948f9ada9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Applicable Margin signifies the additional percentage added to the base rate benchmark to determine the actual interest charged to borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Alternate Base Rate Advance shall bear interest at a rate per annum equal to the Alternate Base Rate plus the Applicable Margin for such day."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Applicable Margin is influenced by the Public Debt Ratings issued by S&amp;P and Fitch, impacting the cost of borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rates outlined for different pricing levels based on public debt ratings, influencing the total cost of borrowing for the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The margin applicable to revolving loans that are Eurocurrency loans, which is multiplied by the daily amount available to be drawn under the Letter of Credit to calculate the commission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage added to the Eurocurrency Rate to determine the interest rate applicable to the Loans during the Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage rate per annum applicable to Advances at a certain time as set forth in the Pricing Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any claims or obligations binding on the Borrower can also pertain to the Borrower's Property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or properties owned by the Borrower or any of its subsidiaries that are relevant in the context of financial transactions and assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or property pledged by the borrower as security for the loan that help reduce lender risk by providing recourse in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets owned by the Borrower that were pledged as security for the Loan, providing assurance to the Lenders in case of default on payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the assets owned by the Borrower, which may be considered in relation to the financial condition and obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to assets leased by a Person which may need to be capitalized on their balance sheet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the assets of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries and includes those representing a substantial portion of their consolidated assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"tangible or intangible assets involved in acquisitions or non-ordinary course dispositions referenced in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 8.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Another section in the agreement that specifies the framework for terminations and obligations of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Plans refer to the various obligations defined in the credit agreement related to employee benefits and pension requirements, which are crucial for assessing potential adverse effects on the Borrower's financial health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to specific pension plans mentioned in the context of liabilities and benefits, applicable to the financial framework in credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFUND OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refund Obligation refers to the responsibility of the Borrower to reimburse any amounts received back from tax refunds if certain conditions specified in the agreement are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPENSES INCURRED BY THE LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Essential costs stipulated in the Agreement that the Borrower must reimburse to the Lenders for various services rendered."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNATURE PAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The page where the parties formally sign the agreement, marking the execution of all terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is a section within the credit agreement where Baris Oran has signed to indicate the corporation's consent and agreement to the terms outlined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d81b9e1363c8d74a9928616039bf898a4e320084199374c175400dc46c844593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085127d8b795687738f196be3d8bd8793e3dfdfb65449a25b2d6f47dd548c476</data>
