</node>
<node id="&quot;EXHIBIT H-4&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A form utilized when a partnership has partners claiming the portfolio interest exemption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of U.S. Tax Compliance Certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b8be7665ef2349c16560bc44e858be4f2a2e3bba9133bd6003bb948f9ada9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPROVED FUND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any Fund that is administered or managed by a Lender, an Affiliate of a Lender, or an entity affiliated with a Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial entities that issue Letters of Credit on behalf of the borrower, ensuring obligations are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial institutions or entities that issue letters of credit on behalf of the borrower, providing further assurance for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"ISSUING LENDERS are those financial institutions or entities that issue loans to the BORROWER and are subject to the agreements in the loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders are a subset of lenders involved specifically in the issuance of loans and have rights concerning the resignation of the Administrative Agent and consent to appointment of a successor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders are institutions that issue Letters of Credit as part of the credit agreement. They participate in the financial arrangements under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders are the entities responsible for issuing Letters of Credit and hold rights related to Cash Collateral for financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders are the specific financial institutions responsible for issuing Letters of Credit on behalf of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that issue Letters of Credit and are impacted by the Defaulting Lender’s failure to meet obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that issue financial instruments such as letters of credit, involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific lenders involved in issuing Letters of Credit under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lenders are specific entities within the lending group that issue letters of credit and manage related financial arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Those lenders who issue financial instruments or guarantees under the credit agreement, playing a key role in the credit arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b949bd6b938010a265fb14a53b068d725f73af78772772e2b7ee398ddb3783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legally binding promise by the lenders to provide financing under specified conditions, mentioned in the context of extending maturity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the Lenders' legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under the defined conditions of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the obligations that the Lender agrees to uphold regarding the disbursement of loans or credits to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments represent the Lender's legally binding promise to provide financing under the terms specified in the Loan Documents, linked to obligations and rights regarding Erroneous Payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments signify the lender's legally binding promise to provide financing under specified conditions and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal obligations of the Lender to provide financing to the Borrower up to a specified amount as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The promises made by lenders to provide specific amounts of financing to the borrower under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e62c5ad35244893d47c41c57cf2f91066b96affaf8d1e8160b7b82529c6a81d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b3831b5841bb69061b1fe0e6df962aef02a686803822e68bc9aff48fec74e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNADJUSTED BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term referring to a standard measure used for defining benchmark replacements in financial agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the section in the credit agreement detailing the mitigation obligations of the Lender and Borrower regarding compensation and costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities or individuals that have a relationship with the Borrower or Lenders, which may influence transactions or contractual obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RICHARD RIVERA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Richard Rivera is an obligor in the context of the credit agreement, acting on behalf of CITIBANK, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"Richard Rivera is identified as the Vice President, signing on behalf of CITIBANK, N.A. in the capacity of Administrative Agent and Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b07eaf1cd11ad2db2417fe6ba87a7a0eb64930b9f015b722b79b572a77fc318</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Includes Pricing Schedule, Commitment Schedule, and other documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNEE GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Concurrent assignments to members of an Assignee Group and assignments from members of an Assignee Group to a single Eligible Assignee are treated as a single assignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Two or more Eligible Assignees that are Affiliates of one another or two or more Approved Funds managed by the same investment advisor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE IN LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to alterations in legal regulations that may affect the Terms, such as capital or liquidity requirements impacting the Lender or Issuing Lender’s obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to alterations in legal statutes that may affect the costs associated with the lending process or obligations of the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the occurrence of new laws or changes in existing laws that affect the credit agreement after its signing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of any law, rule, or regulation change that affects the obligations and interpretations under the credit agreement, particularly regarding Capitalized Leases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e62c5ad35244893d47c41c57cf2f91066b96affaf8d1e8160b7b82529c6a81d5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender that is not based in the borrowing jurisdiction, entitled under tax law to exemptions or reductions from withholding tax."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides credit but operates outside of the United States, claiming benefits under U.S. tax laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foreign Lender means any Lender that is not organized under the laws of the United States, any State thereof or the District of Columbia."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b8be7665ef2349c16560bc44e858be4f2a2e3bba9133bd6003bb948f9ada9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNMATURED DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition that must be absent on the Extension Date for the extension of the Stated Maturity Date to become effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"A state indicating potential future defaults or non-compliance that must be disclosed by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term representing a potential default that has not yet occurred but may occur if certain conditions are not met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of default that has not fully materialized, indicating potential future issues related to the Borrower’s financial conditions or commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unmatured Default indicates a situation where the Borrower has not yet defaulted but may do so under certain conditions specified in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unmatured Default refers to a situation where the Borrower has not yet defaulted but is close to doing so, impacting the rights of the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the credit agreement that specifies the notice requirements for Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
