</node>
<node id="&quot;VICE PRESIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TITLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Marko Lukin holds the position of Vice President at DEUTSCHE BANK AG, reflecting significant managerial responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Richard Rivera holds the title of Vice President at CITIBANK, N.A., indicating a seniority and managerial responsibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title held by Stephen J. D’Elia, indicating his position and authority in the credit agreement process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dbd00f6a4880bab897eedd80e2e7ef9e6614202414ed01ad473bc1874a405944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1dfcf35c71b9bc1649a0165fc3f3382c476139fd8e243735127e10bcebe9770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b07eaf1cd11ad2db2417fe6ba87a7a0eb64930b9f015b722b79b572a77fc318</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATE BASE RATE ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of advance referenced in the agreement, provided under specific conditions and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan referenced in relation to the Eurocurrency Advance, altering the terms based on a different interest calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Alternate Base Rate Advance is a type of loan that continues until it is converted into another loan type or repaid per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An advance which bears interest at the Alternate Base Rate unless otherwise specified in Section 2.11."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Alternate Base Rate Advance shall be in the minimum amount of $3,000,000 and in multiples of $1,000,000 if in excess thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Alternate Base Rate Advance is a type of Loan where interest is calculated based on an alternative base rate, affecting the repayment structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may elect from time to time to convert all or any part of an Alternate Base Rate Advance into a Eurocurrency Advance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 2.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A detailed timeline that includes the Existing Letter of Credit issued prior to the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Details Existing Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Referencing a specific section within a wider credit agreement that outlines existing financial instruments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a915934b5ce2936e38d936eaf4dfcba0d99ee6b9c1b8e5e6700b27f717605157</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITALIZED LEASE OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capitalized Lease Obligations are liabilities recognized on the balance sheet related to long-term leasing agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities arising from long-term leases that the Borrower must account for in its financial statements and covenant compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of a Person relating to agreements that would be shown as liabilities under Capitalized Leases on a balance sheet prepared according to Agreement Accounting Principles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN PENSION PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Foreign Pension Plan means any defined benefit plan as described in Section 3(35) of ERISA for which the Borrower, any Subsidiary or any member of the Controlled Group is a sponsor or administrator or to which the Borrower, any Subsidiary or any member of the Controlled Group has any liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFIED INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined term in the agreement referring to any contractual borrowing obligations of the borrower as managed in compliance with the sections outlined in this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specified Indebtedness represents particular forms of borrowing that are subject to restrictions or definitions within the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARCH 5, 2021&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The date on which the Financial Conduct Authority announced the future cessation of LIBOR settings, impacting interest rate calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific provision within the agreement detailing indemnity obligations and the non-liability clauses related to damages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNATURE PAGE TO CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document indicating the execution of the credit agreement, where authorized signatories acknowledge and affirm the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Signature Page to Credit Agreement indicates the formal acknowledgment and acceptance of the terms laid out between the parties, marking a critical part of the legal document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation that captures the endorsement of the parties involved in the credit agreement through signatures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The reference to the 'Signature Page to Credit Agreement' indicates the formal documentation related to binding contractual obligations between the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page indicates the formal execution of the credit agreement by the involved parties, signifying their commitment to the terms outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is a formal part of the credit agreement where authorized representatives sign to indicate their acceptance of the terms and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"This document contains the signature page pertaining to the Credit Agreement, formalizing the commitment of CITIBANK, N.A. and its representatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"This page is part of the formal credit agreement that includes the signatures from key individuals involved in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b07eaf1cd11ad2db2417fe6ba87a7a0eb64930b9f015b722b79b572a77fc318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca38ab95adfdbe4b350ba2362f9f8fe98e4dcb1c2431762df158825712536420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9a3f2801531543f6efeaa8514c27751db261258826ff79c3d2c2444342387b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b6ca2d4cc5d7f872dbe6f980264adf59bac19f237f2d2651238e50ce7188c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd0c028e302476e09dd503806f9811bd0cf832ba19f4bfa5ae4fc8c17ac0076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a79807e92594c4003f57454952f892517d7cb041b2a1bf51bd4b43ce5b6036f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29dd8b936048858baf9dafeb8b935be94e696c900a73da13e5dbbe1db3ee806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 6.10&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the document outlining existing specified indebtedness for borrowed money."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outlines Existing Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5d2e9559a3e41bedbcb74a8ec244da6481b4b7647a1f0f2ba21cfbb361525f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATE BASE RATE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A revolving loan that bears interest at the Alternate Base Rate as per the terms stipulated in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority that oversees the enforcement and compliance with laws, which may impact obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for the enactment and enforcement of laws that may impact the terms and compliance of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any agency or entity that has the authority to govern and enforce regulations affecting the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity or authority that is responsible for enforcing relevant laws and regulations regarding credit and lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority means the government of the United States or any other nation, or of any political subdivision thereof, and any agency, authority, instrumentality, regulatory body, court, central bank or other entity exercising executive, legislative, judicial, taxing, regulatory or administrative powers or functions of or pertaining to government."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to the bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws and regulations applicable to the Borrower, Administrative Agent, and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any authority responsible for imposing taxes or other charges as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authorities or bodies responsible for overseeing and enforcing compliance with laws, rules, and regulations that govern credit agreements and financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFINING EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXPOSURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fronting Exposure means, at any time there is a Defaulting Lender, with respect to any Issuing Lender, such Defaulting Lender’s Pro Rata Share of the outstanding L/C Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition under which the Borrower fails to meet obligations as specified in the agreement, triggering certain restrictions on assignments to Defaulting Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A failure to meet the contractual obligations as specified in the credit agreement, triggering potential penalties or actions from Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A situation where the Borrower fails to meet agreed-upon financial obligations, triggering provisions in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term used to define a failure to meet the obligations as per the terms of the credit agreement, which may require a waiver for continuation of terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event in which the Borrower fails to meet the obligations as described in the Agreement, which may trigger penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default occurs when the Borrower fails to meet certain obligations outlined in the credit agreement, triggering specific consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to a situation where the Borrower fails to meet its financial obligations under the terms of the Loan Documents, triggering potential repercussions such as setoff rights and actions by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the failure of the Borrower to meet the obligations specified in the Loan Documents, triggering potential penalties or actions from the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the failure of the Borrower to meet the obligations under the credit agreement, which can trigger specific rights for the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the situation that can occur if the borrower or lender fails to meet their obligations under the terms of the agreement, which must be communicated to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Section 2.09, when any Default has occurred and is continuing..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any breach of contract terms, which must also not exist for the extension to be valid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of a failure by the Borrower to meet specific obligations under the credit agreement, representing a critical event that could trigger lender remedies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state of failing to meet the obligations set forth in the credit agreement, referenced as a condition that allows Required Lenders to take actions like adjusting interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL CONDUCT AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The UK regulatory body responsible for overseeing LIBOR and its cessation, with implications for credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
