</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.08&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific provision addressing the severability of provisions within the loan documents, ensuring that if one part is unenforceable, the rest remains valid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CRAIG MALLOY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AUTHOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Craig Malloy is mentioned as the individual who signed on behalf of BARCLAYS BANK PLC, holding the position of Director."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULE 13.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A detailed outline that includes the address, telecopier number, electronic mail address, or telephone number for notices related to the Borrower and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lists Certain Addresses for Notices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8adb6747e6b85adc3c69908d58f38beb11f7efbd9f0ae6735a903247929787</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTI-CORRUPTION LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Laws, rules, and regulations applicable to the borrower or its subsidiaries concerning bribery, money laundering, or corruption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to laws aimed at preventing corruption and bribery in business transactions. The Borrower is prohibited from using the proceeds in violation of these laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"L/C Obligations pertain to the Borrower's obligations regarding letters of credit issued as part of the financing arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Obligations refer to the responsibilities the Borrower has regarding the repayment of any letters of credit issued on their behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Obligations refers to the outstanding obligations under Letters of Credit issued by Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Obligations represent the financial commitments the Borrower has under any letters of credit issued as part of the loan agreement, ensuring payment to beneficiaries as agreed."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Obligations will also be reallocated by the Administrative Agent among the Lenders on the applicable Increased Amount Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations related to letters of credit that require funding by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial obligations of lenders related to issuing letters of credit as specified in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial obligations that arise from Letters of Credit issued as part of the credit agreement, secured by the applicable conditions set for the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal, legally binding obligations arising from the Letter of Credit agreements that outline the responsibilities of lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations related to the amounts under Letters of Credit that are outstanding, as defined in the agreement, indicating both undrawn and drawn amounts that have not been reimbursed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The outstanding obligations related to Letters of Credit issued by the Issuing Lenders for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The responsibilities and duties of the Borrower regarding the reimbursement and participation in relation to Letters of Credit issued by the Issuing Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
