</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TITLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Craig Malloy is designated as Director, reflecting his official capacity and responsibilities within BARCLAYS BANK PLC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Director is the title held by Chris Hursey, denoting his position and responsibilities within Truist Bank in relation to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Michael Hoffman's position in BNP Paribas, indicating his authority to act on behalf of the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ming K. Chu serves as a Director at DEUTSCHE BANK AG, indicating a high level of authority and responsibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal role held by Kevin Valenta within Wells Fargo Bank, indicating his position in the organizational hierarchy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title of Director is held by individuals such as Gordon Yip and Paul Arens, signifying their roles in the governance of CRÉDIT AGRICOLE CORPORATE AND INVESTMENT BANK."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b1dfcf35c71b9bc1649a0165fc3f3382c476139fd8e243735127e10bcebe9770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9a3f2801531543f6efeaa8514c27751db261258826ff79c3d2c2444342387b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a79807e92594c4003f57454952f892517d7cb041b2a1bf51bd4b43ce5b6036f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29dd8b936048858baf9dafeb8b935be94e696c900a73da13e5dbbe1db3ee806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66fd0f9a9180e543fe5145a08d528e6028aba0d4342edd7498580d6806dc63d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
