  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE TIME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Local time in the place of settlement necessary for timely borrowing and payments in foreign currency as determined by the Administrative Agent or applicable Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific time acting as a deadline related to transactions and compliance within the credit arrangement, generally set for operations on a Borrowing Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e57ecef8173510fd0d0d5e6cf77680ad2a6c5c66b5fa6f273eec7ca90ac1c97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific reference interest rate defined in the agreement that is used as a benchmark for other financial calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Base Rate means for any Interest Period with respect to a Eurocurrency Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate benchmark used to calculate the rates for Eurocurrency Loans, which may be replaced under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3(35) OF ERISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STANDARD"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the specific section of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act that defines a Foreign Pension Plan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
