</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN CURRENCY OR ADDITIONAL L/C CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any currency that is additional to the Dollar and used in conjunction with the Letter of Credit or related loan obligations, affecting financial calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TENOR OF BENCHMARK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specified duration of a benchmark rate within the loan structure that may be subject to availability assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliates refer to connected companies or entities that share a common control relationship with the lenders involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to related entities or companies associated with the Agents, Lenders, or the Borrower, which may participate in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refers to entities that are related to the Borrower, often through ownership or control, and may engage in business transactions related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities related to the Borrower, which may include subsidiaries or associated companies that are subject to the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Affiliates are related entities that may hold investments in or have other financial relationships with the Borrower and its operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GORDON YIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gordon Yip is a Director signing on behalf of the lender in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-66fd0f9a9180e543fe5145a08d528e6028aba0d4342edd7498580d6806dc63d1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal contract detailing the terms and conditions under which credit is extended to the borrower, including the framework for existing Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal credit agreement involving BANK OF AMERICA, N.A. as the lender and outlining terms, rights, and obligations relevant to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract detailing the rights, obligations, and terms for the Borrower, Lenders, and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the outline rights, obligations, and terms between HSBC Bank USA, N.A. and the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Credit Agreement serves as the formal, legally binding contract that outlines the terms, obligations, and financing arrangements between the lender and the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document refers to a formal credit agreement that outlines the terms between BNP Paribas and its stakeholders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal document detailing the rights and obligations of the parties involved in financing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal, legally binding contract that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms between the lender and borrower. It establishes the foundation for the lending arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dbd00f6a4880bab897eedd80e2e7ef9e6614202414ed01ad473bc1874a405944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca38ab95adfdbe4b350ba2362f9f8fe98e4dcb1c2431762df158825712536420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37e6e036b8be21c8c45f3cf79ef8e42235a69ccb1074a3ce6130ea44d1ebd53b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b29dd8b936048858baf9dafeb8b935be94e696c900a73da13e5dbbe1db3ee806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a915934b5ce2936e38d936eaf4dfcba0d99ee6b9c1b8e5e6700b27f717605157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-085127d8b795687738f196be3d8bd8793e3dfdfb65449a25b2d6f47dd548c476</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined term that refers to the period associated with a Eurocurrency Advance, outlining its duration and conditions for commencement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defines the duration for which a specified interest rate applies within the agreement, dependent on the current Benchmark for the currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Eurocurrency Advance will be governed by the duration of the Interest Period applicable thereto."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the specific timeframe over which interest rates are applied to Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period defines the duration for which the Eurocurrency Advance is applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period indicates the duration over which interest on the Loan is calculated and payable, impacting the timing of payments made by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period refers to the time frame for which interest calculations are made, impacting the rates convertible under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The defined period during which the interest on a loan is calculated, relevant in determining payment schedules and obligations for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated time frame during which specific interest rates and borrowing terms apply to revolving loans, defined by specific dates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duration for which an interest rate is applied, relevant for determining the Rate Determination Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predefined duration for which the interest on the Eurocurrency Loans is calculated before adjustments or repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific duration for which the Eurocurrency Rate is applicable, mentioned in the context of determining interest rates for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific duration for which the interest on an Eurocurrency Advance is calculated, influencing payment dates and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified duration for which certain financial conditions apply under the credit agreement, particularly regarding interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"the definition of 'Interest Period' pertains to the time frame involved for calculating interest payments according to the loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86ff72e75149a1e4989f2e18b97f1c08bc0c56812050e314d6b3d152b159fed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific date mentioned in the agreement marking the official start of the credit arrangement and the execution of documents by all parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is the agreed-upon date on which the Loan transaction is finalized and funds are disbursed to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is the specific date referenced in the document as crucial for the Borrower to fulfill obligations like certifications and payments to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is the specific date upon which the agreement becomes effective and all parties fulfill their signing responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date marks the specific date when the credit agreement and transactions among parties become effective and binding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date signifies the date on which all specified conditions in Section 4.02 of the agreement are satisfied or waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date specifies when the contract becomes effective and when the Borrower and the Lender's duties commence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which all parties have signed the agreement, marking the start of the loan terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the closing of the transaction occurs, subject to the satisfaction of conditions precedent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the loan agreement is formally executed by all parties, marking the commencement of the agreement's provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date at which agreements are finalized, marking the beginning of contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date by which all conditions and documents must be finalized and delivered, marking a critical deadline in the credit agreement process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date by which the Borrower must fulfill certain obligations and provide documentation, marking the finalization of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date from which the availability of Revolving Loans and issuance of Letters of Credit begins, as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which all parties have signed the agreement, signifying the formal commencement of obligations under the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the credit agreement becomes effective, marking the start of the borrower's obligations under the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date upon which the credit agreement becomes effective, marking the formal commencement of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date when the transactions specified in the agreement are completed, marking the end of the negotiation phase and the start of fulfilling contract terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"This term references the date on which significant events related to the credit agreement, such as lenders' obligations, are formally established."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4f7a8234bc1804b6e445146a95d72695c19e55f57401948135577314a75e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a915934b5ce2936e38d936eaf4dfcba0d99ee6b9c1b8e5e6700b27f717605157&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 4(B)(4) OF ERISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STANDARD"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the specific section of ERISA that governs coverage exemption as outlined for Foreign Pension Plans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
