<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL L/C CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional L/C Currency is a category defining currencies approved for the issuance of Letters of Credit beyond those specifically listed in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional L/C Currency refers to any extra currency specified in the Letter of Credit that may be applicable during transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any extra currency designated for the Letter of Credit other than the primary currency specified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59684afb2e463574cf2aaf600c780e0debe3a298245661d942ad591b5ac883c0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WACHTELL, LIPTON, ROSEN &amp; KATZ&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Wachtell, Lipton, Rosen &amp; Katz provide a legal opinion that must be delivered by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent as part of compliance for the Closing Date."</data>
