</node>
<node id="&quot;WELLS FARGO BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution providing loans and credit facilities. In this context, it acts as the lender in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wells Fargo Bank, National Association is a banking institution offering a range of financial services, with a commitment of $65,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."</data>
