<node id="&quot;DELAWARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"JURISDICTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delaware is the state under which GXO Logistics, Inc. is incorporated and recognized as a legal entity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Laws relating to the resolution of unsound or failing banks, investment firms, or other financial institutions as defined in the United Kingdom and EEA Member Countries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legislation that provides regulatory authorities with the power to reduce or convert financial liabilities to assist in the resolution of financial institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to laws and regulations in the United Kingdom and EEA Member Countries that govern the resolution of failing financial institutions through measures other than traditional insolvency proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
