</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSENTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consenting Lender refers to a lender that agrees to specific actions or changes proposed regarding the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender agreeing to a requested extension is referred to as a 'Consenting Lender'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452</data>
