</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATED COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount that the Lenders are obligated to lend to the Borrower, which is subject to certain conditions and limitations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT OR UNMATURED DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A state indicating that the Borrower has not defaulted or has any outstanding issues as of the Closing Date, ensuring compliance with the loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CUSIP NUMBERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CUSIP numbers are identifiers assigned to securities, facilitating tracking and managing investments related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KEVIN VALENTA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The individual representing the lender in the credit agreement, having signed on behalf of Wells Fargo Bank, National Association."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ff9a3f2801531543f6efeaa8514c27751db261258826ff79c3d2c2444342387b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREMENTAL REVOLVING CREDIT COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legally binding promise to provide additional financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions, as outlined for revolving credit loans in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incremental Revolving Credit Commitment refers to a specified commitment amount that can be accessed under the credit agreement, as defined in Section 2.22."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incremental Revolving Credit Commitments shall become effective as of such Increased Amount Date, subject to certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal agreement that signifies the process of obtaining control of a company or its assets, which may involve financial negotiations and restructuring."&lt;SEP&gt;"An important term defined in the Credit Agreement, referring to transactions that involve purchasing assets or equity to expand the Borrower's operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any instance of acquiring another entity or resource, particularly significant when the consideration is large."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of purchasing another entity or its assets, affecting the Borrower's financial structure and metrics."&lt;SEP&gt;"a formal process outlined in the credit agreement for the Borrower or its subsidiaries to acquire Property as referenced in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENEFIT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to any employee benefit plan subject to regulations under ERISA and the Code, which may include certain responsibilities under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd</data>
