</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount under certain conditions, detailing financial commitments as part of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment Fee is a fee defined in the agreement that the Borrower pays for the availability of the loan amount provided by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment Fee is calculated based on the Public Debt Ratings, specifically if only one rating agency has a rating in effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fees associated with the commitment to provide a revolving credit facility at varying percentages depending on the pricing levels."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The overall risk exposure concerning loans and credit facilities extended by the Lenders to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the agreement that contains representations and warranties, which the Borrower certifies as true and correct on the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Article 5 outlines the representations and warranties provided by the Borrower to each Lender and the Agents, affirming the Borrower's status and compliance with lending terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76</data>
