</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBPOENA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A subpoena is a legal document ordering an entity to appear in court or produce requested documents, which could affect confidentiality obligations under the agreement."</data>
