</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINGENT OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contingent Obligations represent obligations that arise under certain conditions, impacting the overall indebtedness of a person as stated in the agreement."</data>
