<node id="&quot;HSBC BANK USA, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HSBC Bank USA, N.A. is a banking institution that provides various financial services, with a commitment of $27,500,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"HSBC Bank USA, N.A. is identified as the financial institution providing the loan to the borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca38ab95adfdbe4b350ba2362f9f8fe98e4dcb1c2431762df158825712536420</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term used to define any given individual or legal entity in the context of financial obligations and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity or individual defined in regulatory terms who may be involved in legal or financial proceedings regarding debt relief."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or entity defined in the agreement that can hold Capitalized Lease Obligations under the specified accounting principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or entity identified in the agreement that may be involved in transactions with the Borrower or Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or legal entity that is treated as the owner of a Foreign Lender for U.S. federal income tax purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity that holds obligations under the credit agreement, referenced generally within the definitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity that is identified within the credit agreement with obligations under the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or legal entity that has obligations under the Loan Document, which can include the Borrower, Lender, and others involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or legal entity that is involved in or may be affected by the agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any legal entity or individual that is involved in the credit agreement, potentially taking on obligations or liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"In the context of the credit agreement, 'Person' refers to entities that may create or incur Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person means any natural person, corporation, firm, joint venture, partnership, limited liability company, association, enterprise, trust or other entity or organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any individual, company, or legal entity mentioned in the Credit Agreement, significant in outlining acquisition definitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Person' in this context generally refers to any legal entity or individual that may engage in business activities or transactions under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term Person refers to any legal entity, which may be a Defaulting Lender in this context, and can be subject to removal from the role of Administrative Agent by the Required Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8be7665ef2349c16560bc44e858be4f2a2e3bba9133bd6003bb948f9ada9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTHORIZED OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Authorized Officer is a designated individual who can act on behalf of the Borrower to complete the Borrowing Notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Authorized Officer is the signatory who certifies compliance with the requirements set forth in the agreement, acting on behalf of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An appointed individual within the Borrower’s organization who must sign the officer’s certificate needed for loan compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any of the President, the Chairman, the Chief Executive Officer, the Chief Financial Officer, the Chief Accounting Officer, any Vice President, the Treasurer, the Assistant Treasurer, the Controller or the Secretary of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b934ac68df115101e3934d25b36c1f0d39ba84bedc9d3bfa855b63fe2cc20e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL MEASURE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consolidated Assets reflects the total assets of the Borrower and its subsidiaries on a consolidated basis as per the most recent balance sheet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property representing more than a defined percentage of the total assets of the Borrower and its subsidiaries, highlighting key financial resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total assets of the Borrower after eliminating intercompany transactions, which is used to assess the size of Major Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total value of assets owned by a company, computed on a consolidated basis, which includes the assets of a subsidiary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes imposed on or with respect to any payment made by or on account of any obligation of the Borrower hereunder, excluding Excluded Taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are specified in the agreement as not subject to certain obligations or liabilities imposed on lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that the Borrower is required to indemnify the Administrative Agent and Lenders for, typically imposed by governmental authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that the Borrower must indemnify the Administrative Agent against, which arise from the obligations of allowing the Borrower to operate under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b3831b5841bb69061b1fe0e6df962aef02a686803822e68bc9aff48fec74e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.20&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section in the Agreement detailing additional terms and conditions that affect the relationship between the parties regarding Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A section of the agreement that deals with the provision and management of Cash Collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific provision that describes the use of Cash Collateral regarding Letters of Credit issued under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.20 outlines the requirements and processes for Cash Collateralization in the event of a Defaulting Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF INCORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal document the Borrower must provide to the Administrative Agent, verifying its establishment and compliance with corporate regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Confidentiality agreements are legal contracts that ensure parties maintain the confidentiality of sensitive information shared in relation to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PATRICK D. MUELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"As the Managing Director, Patrick D. Mueller is an obligor representing HSBC Bank USA, N.A. in the obligations defined within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Patrick D. Mueller is the Managing Director and is involved in signing and representing the lender in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca38ab95adfdbe4b350ba2362f9f8fe98e4dcb1c2431762df158825712536420</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties. In this context, it refers to transactions that may affect the Borrower's financial metrics, such as the Consolidated Leverage Ratio."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant transaction that involves the acquisition of assets, which may impact the Borrower's financial conditions and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term referenced in the definition of Acquisition Debt, denoting significant transactions influencing the Borrower's financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Acquisition with a total consideration equal to or greater than $400,000,000."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVAILABLE TENOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined period used for determining the length of an Interest Period or the payment period for interest calculated with reference to the applicable Benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined time period in which interest payments or loan terms are effective, relative to the overall structure of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Available Tenor” refers to the duration for which the interest rate is applicable, varying for different benchmark rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED EBITDA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial metric for assessing the Borrower and its subsidiaries' earnings, used as a measure of financial performance during a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization, consolidated across the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, used for financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"a financial metric that measures the Borrower's overall profitability and is adjusted to account for certain costs and expenses during a specified period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
