<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.21&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section in the Agreement that specifies further conditions related to the management and issuance processes for Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A section of the agreement detailing the procedures and responsibilities for Defaulting Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific provision within the Agreement that outlines handling issues related to Defaulting Lender exposures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b</data>
