<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF GOOD STANDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document that certifies the Borrower's legal status and compliance with state requirements, which must be delivered to the Administrative Agent during the loan process."</data>
