<node id="&quot;MANAGING DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TITLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Frans Braniotis holds the title of Managing Director, which signifies his role and authority within the lender's organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title held by Patrick D. Mueller, indicating a senior management role within HSBC Bank USA, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tony Baratta's position in BNP Paribas, indicating his authority to act on behalf of the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b29dd8b936048858baf9dafeb8b935be94e696c900a73da13e5dbbe1db3ee806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca38ab95adfdbe4b350ba2362f9f8fe98e4dcb1c2431762df158825712536420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37e6e036b8be21c8c45f3cf79ef8e42235a69ccb1074a3ce6130ea44d1ebd53b</data>
