</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities controlled by the Borrower, which are included in the financial statements required under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities owned or controlled by GXO Logistics, Inc., crucial for the context of the Borrower's acquisitions and debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities owned or controlled by the Borrower that may be involved in the agreement or have related obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are controlled by the Borrower, which may have their own obligations and relationships under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal entities owned or controlled by the Borrower, which may collectively affect the financial position and obligations of the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legally separate entities owned or controlled by the Borrower, mentioned in the context of financial calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries are companies controlled by the Borrower that must adhere to the stipulations set forth in the credit agreement regarding indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries refer to the entities under the Borrower that must also comply with the terms of the credit agreement, including maintaining good standing and compliance with laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are legal business entities under the control of the Borrower, involved in the operations and financial activities related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The consolidated financial condition and operations of the Borrower include its Subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a legal action taken regarding a defaulting entity's assets, outlining the intervention procedures for maintaining financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The exercise of any Write-Down and Conversion Powers by the applicable Resolution Authority in respect of any liability of an Affected Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The potential effects on liabilities of the Borrower including reduction or cancellation resulting from regulatory action applicable to Affected Financial Institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
