</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED NET INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Calculated net income for the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for a period, determined in accordance with Agreement Accounting Principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The net income of the Borrower and its subsidiaries, calculated for a specific period and used in determining Consolidated EBITDA."&lt;SEP&gt;"the amount added back to Consolidated Net Income pursuant to this clause related to cash paid in connection with Acquisitions and non-ordinary course dispositions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
