</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of loan arrangement mentioned in the credit agreement that involves interest rate calculations based on a defined period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of short-term loan or financial facility that is available in multiple currencies, typically used for international transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Eurocurrency Advance shall be in the minimum amount of $5,000,000 and in multiples of $1,000,000 if in excess thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Advance is a specified type of Advance which has its own Interest Period and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to advances made in foreign currencies, as indicated in the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Eurocurrency Advance represents a specific loan structure where interest payments are made based on Eurocurrency rates, providing a unique borrowing option."&lt;SEP&gt;"such Eurocurrency Advance shall be automatically continued as a Eurocurrency Advance in its original currency with an Interest Period of one month."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional participants that accept and purchase interests in each Issuing Lender's obligations and rights under each Letter of Credit issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that take part in the Letters of Credit process, responsible for backing the credit extended to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
