</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUEST FOR CREDIT EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Request for Credit Extension is a formal process through which the Borrower requests an increase in the amount of financing provided under the loan agreement."</data>
