</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A set of laws that govern the proceedings involving debtors who are unable to repay their loans, allowing for an orderly resolution of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law encompasses legal statutes that provide relief to borrowers who are in financial distress, influencing the Borrower's obligations under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5</data>
