</node>
<node id="&quot;THE BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Bank of Nova Scotia is a financial institution offering various banking services, with a commitment of $27,500,000.00 in this credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bank of Nova Scotia is identified as a lender in the credit agreement and is responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37e6e036b8be21c8c45f3cf79ef8e42235a69ccb1074a3ce6130ea44d1ebd53b</data>
