</node>
<node id="&quot;EVIDENCE OF AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONTRACT TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Terms describing the necessary documentation ensuring that parties involved have the legal power to act and fulfill the terms of the Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
