</node>
<node id="&quot;CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the Internal Revenue Code which governs federal tax laws in the U.S."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the Internal Revenue Code which provides regulatory parameters around employee benefit plans and related deductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the Internal Revenue Code, the body of laws governing federal tax in the United States, which includes definitions pertinent to financial transactions and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the legal statutes that govern the withholding taxes applicable to payments made to Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8be7665ef2349c16560bc44e858be4f2a2e3bba9133bd6003bb948f9ada9a9</data>
