</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED INTEREST CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Means for any period, the sum of interest, premium payments, amortization of debt discount, fees, and other expenses for the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, treated as interest in accordance with GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total interest expenses incurred by the Borrower and its subsidiaries during a specific period, part of the calculation for Consolidated EBITDA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ISP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Short for 'International Standby Practices 1998,' outlining practices for standby letters of credit, relevant for compliance and legal adherence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-576016c27227f1274c576bb6ae3aea1bd30d70b82b82d38d005067bbfc360503</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fee that the Borrower must pay to the Administrative Agent for the account of the applicable Issuing Lender and the L/C Participants related to each Letter of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 4.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Article 4.03 provides detailed procedural requirements and conditions that must be met for requests for additional credit to be honored."</data>
