</node>
<node id="&quot;FIDUCIARY DUTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fiduciary Duty refers to the obligation that the Administrative Agent has to act in the best interest of the Lenders, impacting operational decisions in managing the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRANS BRANIOTIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Frans Braniotis acts as the Managing Director, likely representing the lender in administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Frans Braniotis is identified in the context of the credit agreement, indicating his obligation or involvement with the terms agreed by the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-37e6e036b8be21c8c45f3cf79ef8e42235a69ccb1074a3ce6130ea44d1ebd53b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial obligation that must be repaid, which can include various forms of debt such as loans, mortgages, and bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term used in the Credit Agreement to describe the Borrower's financial obligations or debts at any given time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness involves various obligations of a Person for borrowed money and other financial responsibilities defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, typically in terms of loans or financial debts, that are consolidated for the purpose of accounting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the state of being legally obligated to pay money to someone else, often related to financial agreements, including loans and liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must show all material Indebtedness and other liabilities in its financial statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower's obligations to repay borrowed funds, specifically referencing incurrence or repayment related to property acquisitions or dispositions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bdf723e788f5bdac2fae53302bcc6a3f587063abd95608e4809e59284e1e6401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECTIVE 2014/59/EU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legislation from the European Parliament and the Council of the European Union concerning the recovery and resolution of credit institutions and investment firms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITALIZED COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs incurred to acquire revenue contracts or related items, referenced in the context of depreciation and amortization expense."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's legally binding promise to provide financing related to Letters of Credit under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of the Issuing Lender to issue Letters of Credit for the Borrower or its Subsidiaries, defined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific amount that each Issuing Lender agrees to issue in Letters of Credit for the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ISSUANCE FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An additional fee payable by the Borrower directly to each Issuing Lender for each Letter of Credit issued, based on the amount agreed upon between the Issuing Lender and the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.01 outlines the Borrower's existence and standing, ensuring that it is validly incorporated or organized according to applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC MESSAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Electronic Message refers to any digital correspondence related to the agreement which may be relied upon by the Administrative Agent in executing its duties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORGAN STANLEY BANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MORGAN STANLEY BANK, N.A. is identified as a Lender, indicating its role in providing financing under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Bank, N.A. is a financial institution engaged in investment banking and financial services, with a commitment of $65,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fd0c028e302476e09dd503806f9811bd0cf832ba19f4bfa5ae4fc8c17ac0076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00c71dd0104564827385ff8082a059de93da9189f0eabcb8930d7245af3fbdbe</data>
