</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONTRACT TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A generic term referring to any exchange or agreement between parties covered under the Credit Agreement, particularly in the context of Acquisition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
