</node>
<node id="&quot;JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jurisdiction refers to the legal authority under which the Borrower is organized and operates, which is essential for compliance with laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Certificate is a formal document affirming certain facts or events related to the Loan or the parties involved, vital for compliance and verification processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A certificate, as mentioned, is a formal document signed by the Authorized Officer certifying compliance with the agreement's terms and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b934ac68df115101e3934d25b36c1f0d39ba84bedc9d3bfa855b63fe2cc20e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a</data>
