</node>
<node id="&quot;MICHAEL KING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Michael King serves as the Authorized Signatory for MORGAN STANLEY BANK, N.A., implying his authority to act on behalf of the lender in the execution of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fd0c028e302476e09dd503806f9811bd0cf832ba19f4bfa5ae4fc8c17ac0076</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan refers to the amount provided by Lenders to the Borrower based on the terms and conditions set forth in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the financing arrangement between the borrower and lenders, defining terms of borrowing, repayment schedules, and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sum of money that is borrowed and is expected to be paid back with interest, as detailed in the Agreement between the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"An extension of credit by the Lender to the Borrower in the form of a Revolving Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan encompasses all financial obligations, including loans and related debts owed by the Borrower to various lending entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan refers to the amount of principal and interest payable which is provided by the Lender to the Borrower, governed by the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan refers to the financial amount provided to the Borrower by the Lender as part of the credit agreement, subject to terms outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan refers to the sum of money provided by the Lenders to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement, which must be repaid according to the outlined schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan represents the financial obligation that the Borrower must repay to the Lender under the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The funds provided to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement, which the Borrower is obligated to repay according to specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The structured credit arrangement outlined in the Agreement that details the specific terms of borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sum of money provided to the Borrower by the Lenders as per the Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITE-DOWN AND CONVERSION POWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Powers exercised by the Resolution Authority to manage liabilities during the resolution of financial distress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Powers that allow resolution authorities to reduce the principal amount of a liability or convert it into equity to stabilize financial institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory powers that allow the resolution authority to reduce the liabilities of financial institutions, impacting unsecured liabilities under the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30dfd32b0cc9b04004fb69c1cd353fb396870e7d97974f09ab4577578d08dfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED INTEREST CHARGES FOR SUCH PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interest expenses recognized by the Borrower and its subsidiaries during a particular accounting period, factored into their financial metrics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C SUBLIMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The maximum amount of L/C Obligations that can be outstanding under the Letters of Credit issued for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum limit established for the total amount of Letters of Credit that can be issued, denoted as the lesser of specific financial values in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C PARTICIPATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The agreement between Issuing Lenders and L/C Participants regarding the purchase and acceptance of an undivided interest in the obligations under each Letter of Credit issued."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOARD OF DIRECTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Board of Directors oversees the management of the Borrower and authorizes significant actions, including the execution of Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Perfection refers to the legal process of making a lender's security interest in collateral legally enforceable against third parties, essential in the context of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTHORIZED SIGNATORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Authorized Signatory title refers to an individual designated to act on behalf of the lender in executing the credit agreement, holding the responsibility of obligating the lender to the terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8fd0c028e302476e09dd503806f9811bd0cf832ba19f4bfa5ae4fc8c17ac0076</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PURPOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONTRACT TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The reasons articulated within the Credit Agreement for which the Borrower is acquiring the revolving credit facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial term relating to a new or alternative rate established to replace a previously set benchmark rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A modification to the existing benchmark rates applicable in the loan agreement, which can be implemented without additional consent from other parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement will replace the then-current Benchmark for all purposes hereunder and under any Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"the formula for calculating any successor rates identified pursuant to the definition of 'Benchmark Replacement' and to permit the administration thereof by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Benchmark Replacement” means, for any Available Tenor: ... the published component used in the calculation thereof."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL, STATE, LOCAL AND FOREIGN INCOME TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Various taxes applicable to the Borrower and its subsidiaries, which are part of their financial obligations and calculations of net income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER JOINDER AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal agreement allowing new lenders to join the credit arrangement, as specified in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Incremental Revolving Credit Commitments shall be effected pursuant to one or more Lender Joinder Agreements executed and delivered by the Borrower, the Administrative Agent and applicable Incremental Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c89d63d96bc9f898e7d1e68ccb7e0afa2d66f4dc3885f8b3cb4e72b0a2720b2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRAFT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
