<node id="&quot;BANK OF AMERICA, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"As a lender, BANK OF AMERICA, N.A. provides financial services and resources under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bank of America, N.A. is a financial institution that provides various banking and financial services, with a commitment of $65,000,000.00 in this credit agreement."</data>
