  <data key="d0">"CONTRACT TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions refer to specific requirements outlined in the Loan Documents that must be satisfied for the Lenders to disburse funds or take other actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific requirements outlined in the Credit Agreement that must be met for the loan to be provided by the Lenders to the Borrower."</data>
