  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the forward-looking term rate based on SOFR that is relevant for the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the sum of: (i) Term SOFR and (ii) 0.11448% (11.448 basis points) for an Available Tenor of one month’s duration..."</data>
