  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A request document required for the issuance of a Letter of Credit, defining details needed for the bank to guarantee payment on behalf of the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An application requesting the Issuing Lender to issue, extend, or increase a Letter of Credit."</data>
