<node id="&quot;L/C PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"L/C Participant refers to any party that is involved or participates in the Letter of Credit transactions, sharing rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Participants are entities that participate in the letter of credit arrangement and have obligations to reimburse the Issuing Lender for payments made on behalf of the Borrower."</data>
