  <data key="d1">"Stephen J. D’Elia is identified as an obligor in the context of the agreement, assuming responsibilities in relation to the credit extended by BANK OF AMERICA, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stephen J. D’Elia, as Vice President, is authorized to act on behalf of BANK OF AMERICA, N.A. in the credit agreement."</data>
