<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If the Benchmark Replacement is Daily Simple SOFR, all interest payments will be payable on a quarterly basis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rate for business loans based on SOFR, determined by the Administrative Agent with specific conventions."&lt;SEP&gt;"the sum of: (i) Daily Simple SOFR and (ii) the spread adjustment selected or recommended by the Relevant Governmental Body..."</data>
