</node>
<node id="&quot;MAJOR SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Major Subsidiary is a significant subsidiary that may have specific obligations under the agreement, particularly relating to indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Subsidiary of the Borrower that has total assets exceeding 10% of Consolidated Assets at any point in time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any significant subsidiary of the Borrower which is subject to additional restrictions or obligations under the credit agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Major Subsidiaries are significant entities within the Borrower's organization that play a key role in fulfilling obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a significant subsidiary which does not act as a guarantor for the indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Significant subsidiary of the Borrower that plays a crucial role in the Borrower's financial structure and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Certificate of Issuing Lender is a formal document affirming the amounts owed under the specified section, serving as conclusive evidence of debt obligation in the absence of error."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4612e85e877c62baf82cad7c2be4131f22c11ab0ba5b0025b887d602b61f41e4</data>
