</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL PRINCIPLES OF EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The enforceability of the Loan Documents may be limited by general principles of equity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
