<node id="&quot;NOTICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents or communications detailing important information or updates to be exchanged among parties under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notices are formal communications provided by one party to another according to the terms of the Loan Documents, often necessary for compliance and execution of agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9508aaaa2cc35b99a72e9bfe92dfe2bfa2bab730720841a5b147639395b735ca</data>
