</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All financial requirements and responsibilities that the Borrower must fulfill under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to all debts, liabilities, and duties of the Borrower to the Lenders and other entities, including guarantees and indemnifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the binding duties of the Borrower concerning payments and compliance as detailed in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the legally binding promises made by the Borrower to repay the loan and fulfill other terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the responsibilities and duties that the Borrower must fulfill as outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the responsibilities of the Borrower to repay the amounts due under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the responsibilities that the Borrower must fulfill under the Loan Documents, including payments and actions to be taken concerning errors in payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for the payment and performance of its Obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations as referenced in the agreement pertain to the duties and responsibilities that the Borrower must fulfill, including payment and performance requirements under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual obligations that the Borrower is required to fulfill under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The contractual obligations that the borrower must fulfill under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duties and responsibilities that the Borrower and other parties must fulfill as outlined in the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duties and responsibilities that the Borrower, Lender, and other parties have under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The responsibilities and duties that the borrower must fulfill under the loan agreement, including repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific commitments made by the Borrower, which include the timely payment of principal, interest, and other fees as prescribed in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The totality of debts and responsibilities the Borrower has, including payments on principal, interest, and fees outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32220edb2c51a75bea6e67cd0e5a1fbeb1a2abce31b2cffece621f54b4b8aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6da2eeb855bc4db1527cd23dadabfc8740772aed447426187bdf23324a009ce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ce561170a0fb74a317902ec18937377457ffce5b30932924c9dcb1321a73c3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT GOVERNMENTAL BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the authority that selects or recommends the applicable interest rates relevant for the Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority that establishes the conventions for rates like Daily Simple SOFR applicable to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"including any applicable recommendations made by the Relevant Governmental Body..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-CASH EXPENSES, LOSSES OR CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Expenses, losses, or charges that do not involve actual cash outflow, part of the Borrower's financial assessment metrics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
