</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATE BASE RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan that may be used as an alternative to Eurocurrency Loans when certain conditions regarding interest rates are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan with an interest rate based on an alternative benchmark rate, providing flexible borrowing terms to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower will be deemed to have converted the request into a request for Alternate Base Rate Loans if LIBOR is not available."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Alternate Base Rate Loans refer to a specific type of loan that entails an interest rate structure based on an alternative base rate, which is mentioned in relation to the Borrower's obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are a type of loan under the Advances that follow a base rate for determining interest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL VALIDITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Loan Documents are legal, valid, and binding obligations enforceable against the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMUNICATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Statements refer to verbal or written assertions made by the parties concerning compliance or other matters related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
