<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">Lenders are defined as financial institutions or entities that provide loans to the Borrower under the terms specified in the credit agreement. They are responsible for disbursing funds, monitoring compliance with the agreement, and honoring requests for credit extensions. Each Lender must advise the Borrower regarding their agreement or disagreement with a requested extension of the loan following the Borrower’s notice.

These entities play a crucial role in providing financing through their commitments, which are outlined in the credit agreement, and have responsibilities regarding the Borrower's performance and conditions that must be met prior to disbursement. Lenders benefit from managed accounts, such as Cash Collateral, which handle excess amounts received during loan repayments.

In addition to loan provision, Lenders participate in the approval and issuance processes for various financial products, including Eurocurrency Loans and Letters of Credit. They are entitled to certain disclosures as mandated by legal regulations and must comply with the terms of the agreement while maintaining a vested interest in the repayment conditions.

The Lenders also have the right to receive necessary documentation and payments as outlined in the loan documents. They may rely on electronic signatures that are purportedly given by or on behalf of the Borrower. Overall, they form the financial backbone of the lending process, ensuring that loans are provided, terms are met, and compliance is maintained throughout the duration of the credit agreement.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b34c24607ec90e75db330e8f024fc166d7fb83cc0ea29a817bbe6967bcfe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecaefa3c2ad5e19bb3010a0abd8a00b9385343a23c01dd136cc52a12bf1c8a23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e40a6ce74fe978e7cab7bc4b2d776d5500985fc28b4f39192e445d1dae7277ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b949bd6b938010a265fb14a53b068d725f73af78772772e2b7ee398ddb3783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988baef871db4cd892d141bb544160c46b90b02279e9f9ea056c5d720e9daca3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a