<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "AGREEMENT" is a formal, legally binding contract that delineates the rights, obligations, and terms among the parties involved, particularly in the context of credit transactions. This document serves to outline various components critical to the financial arrangement, including but not limited to loan amounts, repayment schedules, interest rates, and collateral requirements. It establishes a framework for the relationship between the Borrower and the Lender(s), detailing agreements related to loans, credit facilities, and Capitalized Lease Obligations.

The Agreement encompasses essential sections that outline specific provisions for a range of financial transactions, including the management of Letters of Credit. It integrates stipulations that are binding upon the parties and extend to their successors and assigns, thus securing the enforceability of its terms. The legal document also includes norms regarding execution, allowing for counterparts to be deemed originals.

Moreover, the Agreement governs pertinent aspects of the credit context, encapsulating definitions and obligations vital to the understanding and execution of the credit arrangement. In particular, it emphasizes the importance of adhering to benchmarks, such as LIBOR and its potential replacements, which influence the financial calculations and obligations within the context of the loans.

Overall, the "AGREEMENT" represents a comprehensive and structured formalization of the financial relationships between Borrowers, Lenders, and possibly Guarantors, ensuring clarity and legal enforceability of all terms related to the financing arrangement.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-74fe17d67b7fa2ef039d65c49963f2a062ae9ca06eebc03b7ed77e8d41363b6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e40a6ce74fe978e7cab7bc4b2d776d5500985fc28b4f39192e445d1dae7277ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d990607ca6b9c513c4d87a46d457b97a8e231369a24385de07cb159ae613ec7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7c