<node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Lender" refers to a financial institution or entity responsible for providing loans to the Borrower under the terms outlined in the credit agreement. This entity plays a crucial role in the financing process, as it is tasked with disbursing funds and ensuring compliance with the stipulations of the agreement. The Lender is expected to provide necessary documentation, including tax returns or other confidential information as requested.

In the context of the agreement, the Lender is also responsible for the distribution and management of funds, monitoring the Borrower's compliance with the terms of the credit agreement, and ensuring that obligations are fulfilled. Moreover, the Lender may engage in activities such as issuing or participating in Letters of Credit and providing Incremental Revolving Credit Commitments as invited by the Borrower. 

The term "Lender" encompasses multiple entities, including CRÉDIT AGRICOLE CORPORATE AND INVESTMENT BANK and BARCLAYS BANK PLC, both of which serve as financial institutions providing loans under the agreed terms. Each Lender has specific rights and obligations outlined in the agreement, including the potential for assignment of these rights under certain conditions.

Additionally, the Lender retains the right to pursue compensation in instances of defaults or erroneous payments, signaling a proactive responsibility in safeguarding its interests. Lenders are required to adhere to the procedures set forth in the credit agreement, demonstrating a commitment to structured financial practices within the lending process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27cc7ccadb0b52553a85f4e8ffdeee4e8a7fccc4f117304c9420bf47ea12062a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47592a39712b138036905fc1d1df7e9312477e32c44ad87875c7d936e87521f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f189db920c3b77ea3f1a44e39b898e308875e6a8c5b0ae7b825de85e8b9d546f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66fd0f9a9180e543fe5145a08d528e6028aba0d4342edd7498580d6806dc63d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b623889d303abd944391e0a2b66745bd68fa6a7cc9cbfb87f629bd8c0cc5525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57