<edge source="&quot;CASH COLLATERAL&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower provides Cash Collateral to secure the Issuing Lenders' obligations and mitigate Fronting Exposure risks."</data>
  <data key="d6">"collateral security"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CASH COLLATERAL&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">35.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower grants a security interest in Cash Collateral for the benefit of the Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to provide Cash Collateral to eliminate any deficiencies in collateral amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may be required to post Cash Collateral to secure obligations concerning Loans and issued Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide Cash Collateral as security in relation to any outstanding Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide Cash Collateral to meet the requirements of the Letters of Credit in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower pledges cash collateral to the Administrative Agent to secure L/C obligations and other commitments under the agreement."&gt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Security"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides security"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides, eliminates"&lt;SEP&gt;"security interest"&lt;SEP&gt;"security, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;pledge, security</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CASH COLLATERAL&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Issuing Lenders utilize Cash Collateral to mitigate their risk when providing Letters of Credit to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"risk mitigation, credit issuance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291</data>
