</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Participant acquires a portion of the rights and obligations of the Lender under the Agreement, allowing it to benefit from the terms without being the original lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant agrees to comply with the terms and conditions outlined in Section 3.05 as if it were treated as a Lender."</data>
  <data key="d6">"compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"participation"&lt;&lt;"7"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bd902267cf6f0db3be25c1294151e19a0be784f5b9abcd4f5dd33a2f1be9deab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd</data>
