<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RECIPIENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has a specific role in making payments to the Payment Recipient under the Loan Documents, which includes addressing Erroneous Payments as they arise."}</data>
  <data key="d6">9</data>
