</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAYMENT RECIPIENT&quot;" target="&quot;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Payment Recipient is responsible for returning any Erroneous Payments received to the Administrative Agent.&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship highlights that a Payment Recipient may receive an Erroneous Payment, which should be reported back to the Administrative Agent."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Error Reporting"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;["return", "responsibility"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b</data>
