  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicable margin is part of the terms established within the revolving credit agreement, directly affecting interest rates based on credit ratings."</data>
  <data key="d6">"constitutes"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The commitment fee is specified in the revolving credit agreement as a cost of maintaining the credit line available to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"specifies"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL I&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level I is defined within the terms of the revolving credit agreement, affecting the overall cost of credit based on the borrower’s rating."</data>
  <data key="d6">"defines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL II&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level II is established in the revolving credit agreement, representing another tier of applicable costs based on credit rating."</data>
  <data key="d6">"defines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL III&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level III is specified in the revolving credit agreement, impacting borrower costs as determined by established credit ratings."</data>
  <data key="d6">"defines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL IV&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level IV is part of the revolving credit agreement, indicating terms applicable for lower public debt ratings."</data>
  <data key="d6">"defines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL V&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level V is included in the revolving credit agreement, detailing the terms for the lowest level of public debt ratings."</data>
  <data key="d6">"defines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTROLLED GROUP&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is part of a Controlled Group, which must comply with obligations pertaining to multiemployer plans and other liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">"compliance, corporate structure"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291</data>
