</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 3.01&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 3.01 provides the Lender with the basis for seeking compensation from the Borrower for increased operational costs.";&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.01 stipulates the rights of the Lender regarding covenants in the Agreement, enhancing their position in the lending arrangement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Legal Framework"&lt;SEP&gt;"rights"&lt;&lt;"8"</data>
