  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Capitalized Leases are considered a form of Indebtedness, impacting the financial structure of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"considered as"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
