  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECLINING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;EXISTING STATED MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commitment of any Declining Lender terminates on the Existing Stated Maturity Date."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">termination</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE INCOME (LOSS)&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must report Comprehensive Income (Loss) in its financial statements to reflect total earnings."|&gt;"financial reporting"</data>
  <data key="d6">8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRUST&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Payments made to Guarantors in violation of prior waivers are to be held in trust for the benefit of the Lenders."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">Payment Management&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING LEVEL II&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Debt Rating of BBB and BBB− determines the requirements for Pricing Level II and its related costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">"conditional"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLAN&quot;" target="&quot;REPORTABLE EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Plan is subject to events that are defined as Reportable Events under ERISA regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2afd79002837d6455b2622441701b97392842efbe57752aea97657f35f63be89</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PLAN&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Any Person can have liability with respect to an employee benefit plan, thus highlighting the obligations attached to individuals or entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">"liability, obligations"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Eligible Assignees are the entities that can receive rights and obligations transferred from Lenders through assignments."</data>
  <data key="d6">"receives assignments"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3771cda3e13643768381b94281c30943819130272cfee9ae8ac10eee712cd1cb</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Assignee must deliver an administrative questionnaire to the Administrative Agent upon assignment of rights and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Assignment Process"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders may transfer rights or obligations to an Assignee, who then assumes those responsibilities under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"transfer, responsibility"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION PROVISIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent is responsible for enforcing the indemnification provisions in situations where errors occur."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Indemnification Enforcement"&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING LEVEL III&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Debt Rating of BB+ and BB influences the characteristics and pricing level III for borrowers with that rating."</data>
  <data key="d6">"conditional"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender is classified based on their failure to meet lending obligations, impacting their relationship with the Borrower and Agreement terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender has failed to satisfy its payment obligations, impacting the loan participation and repayment structure within the agreement."&lt;&lt;"failure, impact"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender's failure to meet obligations complicates the distribution of obligations among Non-Defaulting Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">"default relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;classification obligations</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Defaulting Lenders cannot assign their rights or obligations without agreement from the Administrative Agent, unless certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent intervenes when a Defaulting Lender has not fulfilled its obligations, managing the repercussions for the Borrower and the remaining Lenders."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent's determination of a Defaulting Lender prompts necessary notifications and actions within the credit agreement framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender fails to fund its part under the Agreement, requiring intervention from the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender must notify the Administrative Agent in writing regarding any failure to fund or comply with obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender's actions can create a requirement for the Administrative Agent to act on behalf of other Lenders, especially pertaining to setoff rights and management of obligations."}</data>
  <data key="d6">"Restrictions, Assignment"&lt;SEP&gt;"default, notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"failure, intervention"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1ca66dd52a177698fde85d2ca5aa568e9318f2e347056e6d1c7b41e4270dff9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee</data>
