  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender may impact the Borrower's ability to amend the Agreement or obtain necessary approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower provides Cash Collateral to cover obligations related to the Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower provides Cash Collateral to cover obligations to the Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender must confirm to the Borrower that it will comply with its funding obligations, indicating a relationship of mutual dependency in fulfilling the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"cash collateralization"&lt;SEP&gt;"confirmation, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"covers, manages"&lt;SEP&gt;contractual consequence</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER'S OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Defaulting Lender must fulfill its obligations to avoid penalties and continue participation in loan agreements."&lt;&lt;"obligation, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d6">7</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;CONDITIONS PRECEDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Defaulting Lender must ensure that all Conditions Precedent are met to avoid being categorized as a Defaulting Lender."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligations, conditions"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;CASH COLLATERALIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"When a Defaulting Lender exists, Cash Collateralization may be required to cover their obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligation management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender's payments are reallocated among Issuing Lenders to cover their obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders' future exposures are at risk due to the actions of the Defaulting Lender in failing to meet funding obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"reallocates, covers"&lt;SEP&gt;"risk, obligations"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender's Pro Rata Share affects the Issuing Lender's L/C Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Credit Relationship"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Defaulting Lender is a term for Lenders who have not met their financial obligations, affecting the overall agreement and the rights of other Lenders.</data>
  <data key="d6">financial compliance</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Defaulting Lender has failed to fund its agreed portion of the Loan in accordance with the established commitments."</data>
  <data key="d6">"failure, funding"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Non-Defaulting Lenders take on a greater share of the obligations due to the Defaulting Lender’s failure to meet its commitments."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligation reallocation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-618d1efd836846b0cf06eb2a24c5cab7fde5952408e2d48093c334c9d12bf902</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender is identified as a Person that can be removed from its position as Administrative Agent under certain conditions."}</data>
  <data key="d6">["removal", "definition", "obligation"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRO RATA SHARE&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent ensures the accurate distribution of the Pro Rata Share of loans among lenders as per the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;"distribution, management"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages and allocates each Lender's Pro Rata Share of responsibilities and payments under the agreement."|"</data>
  <data key="d6">7&lt;SEP&gt;financial management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRO RATA SHARE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders receive payments based on their Pro Rata Shares during the repayment of advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payments to Lenders are distributed based on their Pro Rata Share of the specified amounts due under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"distribution, payment"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives payments based on"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRO RATA SHARE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Pro Rata Share defines the commitment of Lenders in relation to their overall credit exposure and indicates their financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pro Rata Share determines how Payments are distributed among the Lenders based on their respective loan amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial arrangement, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment distribution"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CASH FLOWS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's cash flows need to be documented in financial statements, providing insight into financial health and liquidity."|&gt;"financial health"</data>
  <data key="d6">8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING LEVEL IV&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Debt Rating of ≤ BB and BB indicates the terms for Pricing Level IV, affecting commitment costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">"conditional"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Eurocurrency Rate is calculated based on the LIBOR for the relevant Interest Period, thus indicating a direct dependency."</data>
  <data key="d6">"determines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender uses LIBOR as a benchmark for determining the interest rates applicable to loans."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest rate determination"&lt;&lt;"9"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LIBOR is used as the basis for setting the interest rates on the Loan under the terms of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">["Basis for","Setting Interest Rates"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Covenants include provisions that may involve the use of LIBOR for determining interest rates and other financial metrics in compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">7</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-739d2b9f9e92efed1c94d06f4f06b95b9dad05cee37c0a3f33ca801071976fa5</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL CONDUCT AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Financial Conduct Authority oversees the LIBOR rates, impacting the credit agreement's terms."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory oversight"&lt;&lt;"9"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;BENCHMARK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agreement references LIBOR as a current benchmark that could face replacement under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"replacement risk"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7c0f0b68eca4939163d14493fb5157bc0af66d4679ed687caf547fea769ae75c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If LIBOR does not correspond to Term SOFR, the Benchmark Replacement aligns LIBOR with the appropriate Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"When LIBOR ceases to be provided, the Benchmark Replacement shall replace LIBOR for all purposes."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"alignment"&lt;SEP&gt;7</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9757ea69e9251824416395b64d96a7b074fa083b364be2dafa939dcdb1be5cb4</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIBOR&quot;" target="&quot;BENCHMARK TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Benchmark Transition Events include conditions that pertain to the applicability and status of LIBOR as a Benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d6">"credit metric"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders provide funds in the form of loans to borrowers, establishing a direct financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides Loans to the Borrower under agreed terms in the Agreement, signifying a transfer of funds that needs to be repaid with interest."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides the Loans to the Borrower under the terms laid out in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The principal amount of outstanding Loans must be repaid on the Existing Stated Maturity Date."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"funding"&lt;&lt;"9"&lt;SEP&gt;"funding, financial relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan provision"&lt;SEP&gt;repayment</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a36a010b47f6129b71862d6462c2f8800506cc93821ebb6be8b52c7389b7a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-020958809c614156af591a9b3b00a88a21bea48fbc904909f06d8dfd29243168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b331bb28b5b328980bc6448e64c475bba021f2fd90308da50dd38ae5cdac4acd</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is the party responsible for repaying the loans received from the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives Loans from the lenders, which creates a financial obligation to repay the amounts borrowed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives the Loans from the Lender, which are documented and governed by the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrowing"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;relationship_keywords&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-80a8dd5ea3f5d9c099606547630c6c1b040c3735377dece8e8b20ebc9dde7016&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interest charged on the Loans is determined based on the length of the Interest Period as specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest calculation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"When a Default occurs, it affects the terms applicable to the Loans, potentially leading to increased interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">"impact"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interest rate on the Loans is determined by adding the Applicable Margin to the Eurocurrency Rate."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest determination"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e197c6b12698708e1139425ee7f8fcca3ecd69283bc4e33a49d4d969c98e339d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
