</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Applicable Margin is determined based on the Public Debt Ratings from either S&amp;P or Fitch."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable margin levels are conditioned on different public debt ratings, thus defining how charges are adjusted based on the borrower's credit profile."</data>
  <data key="d6">"determines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
