  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Commitment Fee is determined based on the Public Debt Ratings from either S&amp;P or Fitch."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The commitment fee structure is influenced by the public debt rating, indicating how fees vary for different creditworthiness levels."</data>
  <data key="d6">"affects"&lt;SEP&gt;"determines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
