  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING LEVEL V&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Pricing Level V is the condition applied when there are no active Public Debt Ratings from S&amp;P or Fitch."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Debt Rating of ≤ BB− sets the standards for Pricing Level V, outlining the highest charges."</data>
  <data key="d6">"conditional"&lt;SEP&gt;"determines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-81e0fb7f1c5c435e6c2b4165e987629875e6d2647fa4a981997538a14a894cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b75ad0c23b5fa1f6371423a8559a0a155156b57bc3bc1873ffd3ee190135162</data>
