  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must provide notice to the Lender at least three Business Days prior to certain loan actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's requests are subject to processing times defined in terms of Business Days for the issuance of Letters of Credit.";</data>
