  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent will share Borrower Materials with Public Lenders, ensuring they are marked appropriately for compliance purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Public Lender communicates with the Administrative Agent to ensure compliance with securities laws regarding Borrower Materials."</data>
