  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has a relationship with the Public Lender that involves compliance with public finance regulations under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Public Lender provides financing to the Borrower, who is responsible for repayment under the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
