</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTORS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Guarantors are any Subsidiary of the Borrower that becomes a Guarantor as specified in Section 16.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantors provide additional assurance for the Borrower's obligations under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Guarantee Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiary, Guarantee"</data>
