</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTORS&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Guarantors provide a Guarantee under the terms stipulated in the Agreement, ensuring lender protection against default."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Guarantee"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-813e0f062a102cd311a126d8ccafb4d308add9ef8462e3fcb8e090be2ba9f527</data>
