  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARLY OPT-IN ELECTION&quot;" target="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The decision to proceed with an Early Opt-in Election requires approval from the Required Lenders, affecting the benchmark rates and financial terms in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"approval, election"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7db5fb751b12499adad00c6e9873cc48b1ac7976fbcfdb9984836b15af75e99c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Guarantor guarantees the punctual payment of all Obligations of the Borrower.";</data>
  <data key="d6">"guarantee"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Guarantors in relation to the Guaranteed Obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the relationship and obligations that the Guarantor has towards the Borrower.";</data>
  <data key="d6">"oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"represents"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;GUARANTEED OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Guarantor guarantees the payment of the Guaranteed Obligations under the agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor is obliged to fulfill the Guaranteed Obligations in case of default by the Borrower."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor's role is to ensure the fulfillment of the Guaranteed Obligations by the Borrower as part of the agreement.";</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial assurance"&lt;SEP&gt;"guarantees"&lt;SEP&gt;Obligation&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lenders depend on the Guarantors for the assurance of payment of their financial instruments."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"assurance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Guarantor provides additional assurance to the Lenders regarding the repayment of the loan."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"assurance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16.03&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16.03 outlines the obligations of the Guarantors regarding Guaranteed Obligations."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"outlines"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
