  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16.01&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16.01 outlines the conditions whereby an entity becomes a Guarantor under the Agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">Condition for Guarantorship&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
