  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 16.06&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16.06 describes the possible release of a Guarantor from their obligations, contingent upon the Borrower's compliance with the agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">Release Conditions&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Each Guarantor irrevocably waives any claims or other rights that it may now or hereafter acquire against the Borrower that arise from the obligations the Guarantor undertakes."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is supported by the Guarantor, who agrees to repay the loan if the Borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor takes responsibility for fulfilling the Borrower's obligations in case of default."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"support, risk mitigation"&lt;SEP&gt;Waiver of claims&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfae90ac75934f3a0aa495e4b1945f7c157fd6f848b6ca39885db21029c243e9</data>
