  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts with the consent of the Required Lenders in managing the amendments to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts with the consent or at the request of the Required Lenders to manage actions and responsibilities under the agreement."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent must give notice of resignation to the Required Lenders, who then have the right to appoint a successor with Borrower's consent."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders have the authority to remove a Defaulting Lender from its role as Administrative Agent."}</data>
