  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Issuing Lender can facilitate transactions in Foreign Currency through Letters of Credit for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender is involved in evaluating the currency requested for Letters of Credit and grants approvals accordingly."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender may require the Borrower to reimburse in Foreign Currency depending on the terms of the Letter of Credit issued."</data>
