</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CDOR&quot;" target="&quot;BENCHMARK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The agreement includes CDOR as an alternative benchmark, which could also be substituted due to market changes."</data>
