</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may interact with Related Parties concerning obligations or compliance under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must communicate any defaults to the Administrative Agent, who is connected with Related Parties involved in managing the loan."|"</data>
