</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 16.05&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16.05 establishes the continuing nature of the Guarantee, binding the Guarantor until all obligations are fully paid."&lt;</data>
