  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 16.05 describes the Continuing Guaranty which may be impacted by the conditions outlined in Section 16.06 regarding the release of guarantors."</data>
  <data key="d6">"continuing obligation, release"</data>
