<edge source="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS FOR BORROWED MONEY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Indicates the financial debts the Borrower is responsible for under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has a direct obligation to manage and repay its Indebtedness for Borrowed Money as per the stipulations of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower incurs Indebtedness for Borrowed Money to finance its operations or investments."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is contractually obligated to fulfill the terms associated with the Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Financial Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"debt management"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial responsibility"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd455f0d03bf315a1eaea1ebddeb91810cd972f43f562e284f3c072128c7039e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
