</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 8.03&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 8.03 preserves the rights of the Lenders in the event of delays or other issues, ensuring clarity around obligations under the Agreement.</data>
  <data key="d6">rights preservation</data>
