  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank of England acts as the UK Resolution Authority for the UK Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d6">"authority, oversight"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
