  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IFPRU 11.6 applies specific requirements to certain types of UK Financial Institutions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"operational guideline, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-28eca6b21c8946b78c94ecada14fd9db0eacb6599496fdda1580ccb1cd064620</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;UK FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may also have obligations or interactions with UK Financial Institutions as part of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Financial Interaction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e8c4fbb6d8d7fe88b762809004286a6a0c28f25d986986b572f6a307add08c2a</data>
