  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent manages the issuance and drawing processes for Letters of Credit as defined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Letter of Credit Application is necessary to procure a Letter of Credit, detailing the borrower's request for the financial guarantee."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Request Process"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c949aa98795a964a83fee0d2a5cf1003c8a3dcd6bd2a627dc984864d17e0a5d2</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">41.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Letter of Credit acts as an assurance of payment to creditors by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower agrees to indemnify the Issuing Lender for any loss incurred from its inability to purchase foreign currency relating to a drawing under the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower can request a Letter of Credit as a financial guarantee, ensuring obligations are met to beneficiaries."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may utilize a Letter of Credit issued by a Lender to meet certain payment obligations associated with the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may utilize the Letter of Credit issued by the Lenders to fulfill certain payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Letter of Credit is a financial guarantee for obligations of the Borrower as outlined in the Agreement.</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial guarantee"&lt;SEP&gt;"guarantee payment"&lt;SEP&gt;"indemnification, reimbursement"&lt;SEP&gt;"payments"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;financial guarantee</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-758c1989597265c02f92778b7755a4eab1b74b2f2d41a5713c7b39e52d9b065c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b9f25b0f7727d8348c35e3ea577371f86853ec4e30f80fb2c8dcede9f5324a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf023d8a063c56705dcb87212bf4c927c8978394473e8991513f7100ef2ad0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;L/C PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L/C Participants share rights and obligations under the provisions laid out in the Letter of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d6">"participation, rights sharing"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">61.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lender is responsible for issuing Letters of Credit as per the application submitted by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender issues Letters of Credit that benefit the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender issues a Letter of Credit, which guarantees payment on behalf of the Borrower, thus establishing a financial obligation between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender issues the Letter of Credit and is responsible for payments under it."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender issues the Letter of Credit requested by the Borrower, subject to its procedures and conditions.";&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender provides a Letter of Credit to the Borrower, ensuring that payment obligations will be met to a beneficiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender provides and guarantees payment through the Letter of Credit according to the agreement terms."&lt;&lt; "issuance, guarantee"</data>
  <data key="d6">"Issuance"&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuance, Benefit"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"issuance"&lt;SEP&gt;"issuance, guarantee"&lt;SEP&gt;9&lt;SEP&gt;["Responsible for","Issuing"]&lt;SEP&gt;issuance&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdc36e8e6e47ff0270974860558b97778e2ed65a56afbb1fb30ae1565713adc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUER LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lender guarantees payment through a Letter of Credit facilitating payment obligations for the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"guarantee"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SAME DAY FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender requires repayment in Same Day Funds for Advances made to the Borrower, ensuring liquidity and timely payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender may provide same day funds for certain disbursements specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"repayment requirements, cash flow"&lt;SEP&gt;["provides","relates to"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AFFECTED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BAIL-IN ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Bail-In Actions can reduce or cancel liabilities owed by the Borrower to an Affected Financial Institution.";</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory impact"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agent manages and oversees the Aggregate Commitment by communicating and coordinating with the Lenders involved in the credit facility."</data>
  <data key="d6">"manage, oversee"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agent is tasked with notifying the Lender about interest rates applicable to each Advance as well as managing communication regarding commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender makes available its funds to the Agent on the Borrowing Date according to the terms of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"make available, fund"&lt;SEP&gt;"notify, manage, communicate"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2f9cbbef1c2c0cf8816bda4b8ba3aad31f6b03ee3c5af5eaff09345647127d74</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDING INSTALLATION&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lending Installation indicates where the Lender operates within the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"indicates, operates"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SANCTION(S)&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sanctions may affect how the terms of the agreement are executed or enforced."</data>
  <data key="d6">["impose","impact"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d</data>
