</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FRAUDULENT TRANSFER&quot;" target="&quot;U.S. BANKRUPTCY CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The U.S. Bankruptcy Code includes provisions that address fraudulent transfers to protect creditors."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"provisions"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f9486f855a0c60e068fa1888069132035c2411f88304d639f451422296a3520c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXHIBIT A&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must submit the compliance certificate in the form of Exhibit A to its lenders, ensuring adherence to financial covenants."|&gt;"compliance, reporting"</data>
  <data key="d6">8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Aggregate Commitment represents the total funding that Lenders are legally obligated to provide to the Borrower according to the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total funding obligation of Lenders is defined by the Aggregate Commitment of the Revolving Credit Facility."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligation, commitment"&lt;SEP&gt;"total funding"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788c1a0d88f1541100bf054380b01f260c6ad5ad3928a6c14b72431c8a554338</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower agrees not to exceed the Aggregate Commitment when requesting advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may reduce the Aggregate Commitment under the specified conditions."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Reduction, Obligation"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"complies with limits"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-605a0a649ed9d8dcac855bd74fdb2b5dcf7f60e5a33e660425be8d3d05cdf833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;OUTSTANDING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Aggregate Commitment cannot be reduced below the level of the Outstanding Credit Exposure, ensuring financial stability for lenders."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Restriction, Financial Stability"&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4470aa58220853274314c41720613105a1a0ab6fee66f35905d8edd5cb9e8a35</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders collectively establish the Aggregate Commitment, which defines the total loan amounts available to borrowers, illustrating their financial collaboration."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial collaboration, total loan"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-44797860849e2e41a0d2a3e915798bd15d6bbb0726f9570b37ae1253ed1a9528</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Important timelines and actions related to borrowing and issuing Letters of Credit are based on the definition of a Business Day."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must take action on or before the specified Business Day to notify the Issuing Lender regarding their reimbursement intention."</data>
  <data key="d6">"timing obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"timing, scheduling"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
