<edge source="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Effective Date is marked by conditions satisfied or waived by the Borrower, initiating obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Effective Date signifies when the Borrower’s obligations under the credit agreement officially begin."&lt;SEP&gt;"The required documents and certifications from the Borrower are essential to establish the Effective Date, from which the loan terms become binding."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Commencement, Initiation"&lt;SEP&gt;"contract commencement, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;timing, obligations&lt;</data>
