  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Arrangers work with the Lender to structure and coordinate the loan provision to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders rely on Arrangers for transaction facilitation and agreement terms finalization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders work with arrangers to facilitate the issuance of loans and manage the logistics associated with credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arrangers coordinate with the Lender to facilitate the structuring of the loan agreements and ensure proper execution of the credit arrangements.</data>
