<edge source="&quot;PROPERTY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">35.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower holds ownership of various properties that are significant assets in its financial dealings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower pledges their Property as collateral for the Loan, providing security for the Lenders in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's Property serves as collateral for loans and obligations, securing the lender's interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower’s assets are referenced under the collateral terms in the agreement, which affect its liability."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower is involved in transactions concerning the Property as noted in the credit agreement related to Acquisitions or dispositions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"affects liability"&lt;SEP&gt;"collateral, asset security"&lt;SEP&gt;"collateral, security"&lt;SEP&gt;"ownership"&lt;SEP&gt;"transaction involvement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
