<edge source="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Issuing Lenders, as a group with the Lenders, play a role in the resignation and successor appointment processes concerning the Administrative Agent."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates interactions between the Borrower and Issuing Lenders regarding cash collateral and other obligations."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is also responsible for handling payments and communications with the Issuing Lenders, ensuring their interests are managed as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the distribution and application of payments for the Issuing Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">"manages, distributes"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment management, representation"&lt;SEP&gt;["involvement", "succession", "authority"]&lt;SEP&gt;facilitation, obligation</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a3e41e26cebf9acc28cdb3ea223550400ffc870eb3272b969bfbe4bbb593592f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6</data>
