  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ISSUING LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">44.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ISSUING LENDERS provide the loan to the BORROWER, thereby creating a financial obligation that must be fulfilled according to the loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing Lenders work directly with the Borrower to provide specific financial instruments, such as letters of credit, under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has financial obligations to the Issuing Lenders concerning the Letters of Credit issued on their behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lenders issue Letters of Credit for the Borrower, guaranteeing payments to specified beneficiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lenders issue guarantees on behalf of the Borrower, ensuring that the Borrower meets its financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lenders provide Letters of Credit to the Borrower, guaranteeing payments for specified transactions within the framework of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Guarantee"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligation, credit arrangement"&lt;SEP&gt;"guarantee, financial support"&lt;SEP&gt;"issues, guarantees"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"provide instruments, working with"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de38d9f190c7d6bcbaaaede79f19cbb59631f72bbfd31261e61e07ea73ad5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3bbcdcac28460a88f270c9607c68ef7cf56adb35a57ee8ffc3598a2b475b3a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49b949bd6b938010a265fb14a53b068d725f73af78772772e2b7ee398ddb3783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders maintain specific commitments outlined in the agreement that detail their financial obligations to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders have established Commitments that outline their promise to provide funds to the Borrower, subject to the conditions defined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"contractual obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligation, promise"</data>
