<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNEE GROUP&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The assignee group can include entities affiliated with the lender, managing the risks and responsibilities associated with credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assignee group consists of eligible assignees that might be affiliates of the lender, coordinating assigned responsibilities."</data>
