  <data key="d5">"A Foreign Lender may provide financing to the Borrower and is defined as an entity not organized under U.S. laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Foreign Lender provides funds to the Borrower, potentially with considerations for tax exemptions or reduced withholdings according to international agreements."</data>
