<edge source="&quot;UNMATURED DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Unmatured Default signifies early signs of potential default risks regarding the Borrower's obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must disclose any Unmatured Defaults that may arise, affecting its compliance status."|&gt;"potential non-compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower should be in a state free of Unmatured Default to qualify for further financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The absence of Unmatured Default is a condition for the Borrower to request an extension of the Stated Maturity Date."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"must satisfy"&lt;SEP&gt;"risk indication"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;condition</data>
