<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Governmental Authority oversees and regulates the actions of Lenders to ensure compliance with national lending laws."</data>
