</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is compliant with regulations set by the Governmental Authority, which impacts loan conditions."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to provide tax documentation to the Governmental Authority as instructed by the Administrative Agent.".&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with regulations set forth by the Governmental Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must timely pay any Other Taxes to the relevant Governmental Authority in accordance with applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Regulatory Compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance"&lt;&lt;"7"&lt;SEP&gt;"tax compliance obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"tax, documentation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-316ccc56cc60f9514fa9482fd69181c1346e0b4f2c6ec2d017e1e2b87388d3f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-369742b947eb975088213077aacde47f5316c0bade4e9d6cf868e117dff1e43c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-389432f97c0d9acb329730d29e0276eba93dc70c0916c74399e531affb7eace1</data>
