  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Default indicates the failure of the Borrower to meet contractual obligations, impacting the rights of Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"If a Default occurs, the Lenders are entitled to take measures against the Borrower, including the enforcement of obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Enforcement"&lt;SEP&gt;"failure, rights"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">43.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Default by the Borrower triggers specific rights and actions that can be taken by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the Borrower fails to meet its financial obligations, it is considered to be in Default as per the terms of the agreement."|&gt;"default status"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower faces restrictions when a Default has occurred, impacting the Advance types that may be continued."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must ensure no Default occurs to maintain compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Default condition must be communicated to the Administrative Agent by the Borrower if obligations are not met as per the agreement."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of a Default indicates a failure of the Borrower to meet its obligations under the agreement, potentially affecting their credit standing and lender relationships."</data>
  <data key="d6">"default risk"&lt;SEP&gt;"faces restrictions during"&lt;SEP&gt;"must avoid"&lt;SEP&gt;"triggers, actions"&lt;SEP&gt;10&lt;SEP&gt;7</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-ff7eefa1e3ad5e4629d751cd1f37a6eefb4f68a54e7100f9408cfd863133bcc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cf4e13aa2c6cc0391a25d2ae2caab24fe2617aff917d82593d32932dc3f2bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62</data>
