</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is subject to the defined Interest Period for Eurocurrency Loans, determining when interest payments are due."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must make repayments according to the terms of the Interest Period as defined in the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d6">"repayment schedule"&lt;SEP&gt;relationship_keywords&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-685a00d495c9204f0f1a1fad404c8355f8fbcfe27979b442eb8a80ba6bfa28c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa</data>
