</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Date marks the point where the Lender's obligations commence following the execution of the agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender and the Borrower establish the Closing Date in the credit agreement, marking the commencement of financial terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"establishing effective date"&lt;SEP&gt;4</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f5eedcb76cd764a2217f05b73c4ae7721f473ae9cf62507a503e66709a26e302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50</data>
