  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's actions, including delivering documents and paying fees, are all linked to requirements on the Closing Date for the completion of the loan process."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date marks the official start of the Borrower's loan-related activities under the agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"start, initiation"&lt;SEP&gt;timing, fulfillment&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747</data>
