</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REVOLVING LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower can draw upon Revolving Loans as needed, allowing flexibility in financing up to the agreed limit."&lt;&lt;"flexibility, financing"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is entitled to request Revolving Loans under the terms defined in the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower takes out Revolving Loans as part of their credit facilities."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower utilizes Revolving Loans to manage their financing needs effectively, allowing continuous access to funds.")</data>
  <data key="d6">"borrowing, financing"&lt;SEP&gt;9&lt;SEP&gt;["loan type", "drawing", "repayment"]&lt;SEP&gt;entitlement request</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac2e7129863413f7a79efaf0a8f5c494d690324b6cd4ea41a5a342e206f2a1f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f7abefa6ccc55aca68ead2529cd1b73fe04a3bf5203cc613c26a693df88af49</data>
