</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGGREGATED COMMITMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lenders provide their Aggregated Commitment to lend to the Borrower."&lt;</data>
