  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commitment Fee represents a cost incurred by the Borrower in relation to the financing being provided by the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial cost"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-db8e590901b58e9ab12d9ef9e5f4436f0a4d1f8f01c3b35ed7eaf8a841004452</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">22.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower agrees to pay a Commitment Fee to the Administrative Agent for the account of each Lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for paying the Commitment Fee to the Lenders for the availability of funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment Fee is paid by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent, reflecting the costs associated with maintaining the available financing."&lt;</data>
