  <data key="d5">"A Person can become relevant in the context of Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money that the Borrower may be involved with."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower, defined as a specific individual or legal entity, has obligations towards all 'Persons' mentioned in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Person may enter into agreements with the Borrower, placing them in obligations defined by the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
