  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Authorized Officer certifies satisfaction of requirements on behalf of the Borrower, indicating responsibility for compliance with the contract terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Authorized Officer is any designated officer or employee of the Borrower responsible for actioning terms outlined in notices to the Administrative Agent."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower’s Authorized Officer is responsible for signing and certifying various documents required for meeting the obligations of the agreement."&lt;</data>
