  <data key="d4">2.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's decision to engage in a Material Acquisition triggers changes in the financial covenant, specifically the Consolidated Leverage Ratio."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's obligations concerning the Material Acquisition are governed by the terms specified in the definitive documentation."</data>
