</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSOLIDATED EBITDA&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's financial health is reflected in its Consolidated EBITDA, an important metric for creditors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial performance of the Borrower is assessed using the Consolidated EBITDA, which calculates earnings for a given period."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower's financial performance as represented by Consolidated EBITDA is adjusted based on the Borrower's actions in acquiring or disposing of Property."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial assessment"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial performance"&lt;SEP&gt;"reflected in"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSOLIDATED EBITDA&quot;" target="&quot;CONSOLIDATED NET INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation of Consolidated EBITDA is derived from the Consolidated Net Income and various adjustments, indicating their direct relationship in financial metrics."</data>
  <data key="d6">"calculation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSOLIDATED EBITDA&quot;" target="&quot;CONSOLIDATED INTEREST CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consolidated EBITDA includes the Consolidated Interest Charges in its calculations, showcasing its role in understanding overall earnings."</data>
  <data key="d6">"inclusion"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 2.21&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent oversees the procedures outlined in Section 2.21 for managing Defaulting Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">"oversees, manages"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-56f8b8206fc34fa3ec46ca9b971beb5f819724a771480da0f5330492c19f3969</data>
