  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF GOOD STANDING&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must supply a certificate of good standing to confirm its ongoing legal status and ability to enter into the agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">legal status, obligation&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-656448c34d6c39d709cf4f0b3fafa8f15917e254898e468b864268232de70e76</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATERIAL NON-PUBLIC INFORMATION&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender acknowledges that they may receive Material Non-Public Information about the Borrower as part of the lending process, requiring compliance with applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Disclosure, Compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">68.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has legal control over its Subsidiaries which impacts the financial health and obligations of both entities under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for ensuring its Subsidiaries comply with all terms and conditions of the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;relationship_keywords&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for ensuring that its Subsidiaries use the proceeds of the Advances as outlined in the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for managing its Subsidiaries, which may have financial relationships under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for the actions of its Subsidiaries regarding compliance with the agreement's terms on indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for the obligations and liabilities of its Subsidiaries under the credit agreement."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the entity that owns or controls the subsidiaries, responsible for their financial performance and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's financial condition reflects the condition of its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial performance of the Borrower includes the results from its Subsidiaries, as outlined in the required financial statements."|&gt;"financial reporting"</data>
  <data key="d6">"Consolidated financial condition"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance, responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"control, ownership"&lt;SEP&gt;"management"&lt;SEP&gt;"ownership, responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;4&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;parent-subsidiary relationship"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1b73fe97875c42acbd1cfd5ed3bf71a7e121ab6595dfedd5673f1192ddc8c312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eb6beb5032e5b051443a117d7f462e897481c3b1b1279a2781993db4dc904e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94cec9b2a4235d8b990a259fae9e3ef42d84de96f805a4e91a32498fab4de340&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f579af8ae52777bd03c297500e3fc8f4d9da9b71f9f0ab65dbd1d3c5524bce2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4750653dea4761c7fb5326f7df76b1ff5616d96443298ddc9443f9ec1ed46068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
