  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's financial performance is measured through its Consolidated Net Income calculated for periods under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower is responsible for ensuring that the calculations of Consolidated Net Income comply with the terms outlined in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"measured by"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a9ee4f98e9418b2314433f25ffaac06cca4e00777385e22ab35871fe9e0364f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3b6780fd0e89bcf66b5285e12fa8030601922d8b1dd78aa8202b47d2ea1cf0</data>
