  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EUROCURRENCY ADVANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lenders provide the Eurocurrency Advance to the Borrower, defining the terms for the loan.")</data>
