  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may elect to convert portions of an Advance into a Eurocurrency Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may opt for a Eurocurrency Advance, indicating a specific loan structure based on Eurocurrency rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">"converts to"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan option"</data>
