  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Code governs the tax obligations of the Lender under U.S. law with respect to income received from the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Code outlines specific tax responsibility for payments made by Borrowers to the Lender."&lt;</data>
