  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower holds various forms of Indebtedness that are measured in accordance with consolidated financial principles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's financial responsibilities include servicing Indebtedness which is crucial for maintaining operations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower's management of Indebtedness is directly related to the acquisitions or dispositions being accounted for in financial metrics."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"holds"</data>
