  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Each Issuing Lender has its own L/C Commitment which governs the amount of Letters of Credit it can issue."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The L/C Commitment defines the obligation of the Issuing Lender to issue Letters of Credit for the Borrower."</data>
