<edge source="&quot;LETTERS OF CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may request the issuance of Letters of Credit in different currencies, subject to the Administrative Agent's and Issuing Lender's approvals."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may utilize Letters of Credit issued by banks to facilitate transactions and ensure payment to beneficiaries."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower obtains Letters of Credit from Issuing Lenders for transactional assurances in financing activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower utilizes Letters of Credit to ensure obligations can be met even in default situations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial instrument"&lt;SEP&gt;"funding assurance"&lt;SEP&gt;"request"&lt;SEP&gt;"utilization, obligations"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-59684afb2e463574cf2aaf600c780e0debe3a298245661d942ad591b5ac883c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d3d8235da6ab2d73914174a1596810ac479be1cca3c369228533b49ce78efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebe5b7adcaae8d762224c153315aceccb8e517430bcc13042391071b592f8641</data>
