  <data key="d5">"Issuing Lenders are responsible for providing Letters of Credit to the Borrower, enhancing assurance for the lender's financial exposure."&lt;&lt;"issuance, assurance"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender is responsible for issuing and participating in Letters of Credit as part of their obligations under the Agreement."&lt;</data>
