</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lender plays a critical role in managing and ensuring the execution of the loan provided under the terms of the Letter of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d6">"management, execution"</data>
