</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">54.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is a party to the Loan, which outlines their rights and responsibilities in receiving and repaying the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is entitled to receive the Loan under the terms specified in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to repay the Loan provided by the Lender in accordance with the agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the party that requests and receives the Loan from the Lenders under the terms set out in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the recipient of the Loan from the Lender, necessitating adherence to the terms defined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower secures financing through the Loan, which outlines all borrowing terms and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Borrowing, Financial Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation to repay"&lt;SEP&gt;"request, receive"&lt;SEP&gt;"securing funds, loan agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;["Receives","Entitled to"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c2e76bfe06832d96f514332019f438cc910c77413f0617abc31b13b1ced12faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31fbd7065e88ea9bd9a524a193a0c450e9b6d3fea3c531fb95f1ec404e0c737&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9647a89a58b5dd94c4107a499b784dee152c76826fe46e047c882f3d29f4565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77f015c45a7573c444a9980fc7601fb5db09fa6ba499d28d02463542e445a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
