<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender provides the Loan to the Borrower, establishing a contractual relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan is the financial product provided by the Lender to the Borrower, establishing their financial relationship."</data>
