</edge>
<edge source="&quot;L/C SUBLIMIT&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lender must adhere to the L/C Sublimit when issuing Letters of Credit for the Borrower."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The L/C Sublimit establishes the maximum capacity of Letters of Credit that can be issued by the Issuing Lender."</data>
  <data key="d6">"establishes, capacity"&lt;SEP&gt;"limit, issuance"</data>
