<edge source="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent has the authority to implement and inform about Benchmark Replacement changes without needing other parties' consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the process of implementing the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent selects or recommends market conventions or adjustments related to the Benchmark Replacement."</data>
