<edge source="&quot;L/C PARTICIPANT&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"L/C Participants are obligated to reimburse the Issuing Lender for their share of payments made under any Letter of Credit issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"When the Issuing Lender receives any payments related to the Letter of Credit, it distributes the corresponding pro rata share to the L/C Participants."</data>
