<edge source="&quot;DEFERRED OR UNEARNED REVENUE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower manages deferred or unearned revenue as a part of its financial liabilities affecting cash flow and income calculation."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial management"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c4a351a1361d1b2bab080245c9f7cfcbfe265cb6295dad3bae410e60d8a1bc32</data>
