  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAJOR SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower and its Major Subsidiaries work together to manage financial responsibilities outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Major Subsidiary is not permitted to create or incur Specified Indebtedness, which is an obligation within the context of the Borrower's financial management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Major Subsidiary is related to the Borrower but does not assure the indebtedness, indicating potential risks."</data>
  <data key="d6">"does not guarantee"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"restriction, obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-933342c9998e30f355fb1fd9ac245727f7b30b12ae83c53d533846bc90d0efb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dba0097483e6d43680ca18f43e0b34befca3d229494d85657cb0d3ced4f666f</data>
