<edge source="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent oversees the Borrower's compliance with its Obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"oversight, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1</data>
