  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">59.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has contractual Obligations to repay loans and adhere to terms specified in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is contractually obligated to fulfill its obligations per the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to fulfill all financial commitments and obligations outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to fulfill the repayment terms as detailed in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to meet all financial requirements under the terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for fulfilling the Obligations as laid out in the Loan Documents.";&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must fulfill its Obligations as specified within the agreement, ensuring timely payments and adherence to terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's duties and responsibilities are encapsulated in the Obligations, which dictate how the Borrower must interact financially under the agreement."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's financial responsibilities constitute the Obligations that need to be fulfilled under the terms set in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Contractual Obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"Contractual obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"commitment, duties"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligations, responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"fulfills, repayment terms"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility, accountability"&lt;SEP&gt;10</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5b23229f61676fc82b994cebe129ddba04bb9c15c7e9ebf4e7844cba0040e826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3dadd9848a42e3657edcc9a12dafee9a73e1cff19c0413111e18b6834cc291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a015574d7a05a08d9a207880f6e2fce97ba212fa98d485fcccecdf620633b1a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b81e8c9163be938645e4a599c88eeda4c7a60c74354129569709069236e2747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fe353bb910c379d25fe75054e8695fd4392eba70dc8d849dcd9f86d70c5037b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998a753d13e4f1db21d4717dbf25b13a2f2c768e30ac332912250581750f06b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-030278384b922b4dde4eb789cb2a8bc568f20779afcf9493b74bd661c5c80d27</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
