  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders have specific obligations that must be met by the Borrower as delineated in the loan agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender's terms define the Obligations that the Borrower must adhere to as a condition for receiving the Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"loan conditions"&lt;SEP&gt;6</data>
