<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">43.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower and its Subsidiaries have specific obligations under the credit agreement that must be fulfilled."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower controls its Subsidiaries, which may incur liens in relation to secured Indebtedness for Borrowed Money."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may acquire or merge with Subsidiaries, which can affect its financial obligations and liability under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may have one or more Subsidiaries that are legally related entities assisting in operations for financial obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may request Letters of Credit for its Subsidiaries as per the agreement's terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is controlled or owned by the Borrower, directly influencing its operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary of the Borrower joins the Agreement to act as a Guarantor, enhancing the Borrower's credit profile."</data>
  <data key="d6">"controlled by"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial support"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligations within agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"operational relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"related entities"&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;["Joins","Guarantor"]</data>
