<edge source="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">74.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has the authority to execute and deliver the Loan Documents and fulfill its obligations under them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a party to the Loan Documents and involved in the administrative procedures outlined therein."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the Loan Documents, which govern all obligations and rights related to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the terms and conditions specified in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the terms set forth in the Loan Documents with respect to the loans and obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound to the terms specified in the Loan Documents, which outline their repayment and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is legally bound by the terms set forth in the Loan Documents, outlining rights and obligations related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must comply with the terms outlined in the Loan Documents, ensuring they satisfy all the obligations detailed within."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must deliver certified copies of its by-laws and other relevant governance documents as part of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents formally establish the rights and obligations of the Borrower regarding their financial commitments to the Lender."</data>
