  <data key="d4">40.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent is responsible for carrying out duties as specified in the Loan Documents until a successor is appointed."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees compliance with the terms set forth in the Loan Documents."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the compliance and execution of all Loan Documents associated with the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;"compliance, oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent plays a role in managing and adhering to the terms outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The activities and powers of the Administrative Agent are dictated by the provisions outlined in the Loan Documents."|"</data>
