  <data key="d7">chunk-2266a9fc1a73832774525a2886a88ef57d8b9423316f0e4b0b7f4361472cabeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56dfadbbf38deaf8b024ab85a1c130f8a147dc4852082a7387117676f6972937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b591041fb8162698727d6a13b94c260ee88b2e7cbd5d43f9c27b507e795a9d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1993053c0afe71a0a70310c159f65971f4df8e35de1ff74fef6f621fd100f0e0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">77.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts as a coordinator in the issuance process, ensuring communication between the Issuing Lender and the Borrower.";&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates activities and communications on behalf of the Issuing Lender and other lenders involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates with the Issuing Lender regarding interest rate calculations and the issuance of currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent distributes all commissions received pursuant to the agreement among the applicable Issuing Lender and L/C Participants according to their Pro Rata Share."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates the process of communication and coordination between the Issuing Lender and the Borrower, ensuring clarity and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the issuance of financial instruments on behalf of the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees and coordinates the approval process for the Issuing Lender regarding Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent works alongside the Issuing Lender to manage compliance and calculations related to currency conversions."&lt;&lt; "collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender collaborates with the Administrative Agent in managing and overseeing the issuance of Letters of Credit for the Borrower.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender provides updates to the Administrative Agent regarding the issuance of Letters of Credit.";&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent coordinates the actions of the issuing lender regarding funding disbursements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"Coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"coordinates with"&lt;SEP&gt;"coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, financial instruments"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversees, coordinates"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;["collaboration", "management"]&lt;SEP&gt;["coordinates","manages"]&lt;SEP&gt;distribution&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-18226adc50d0d43fc9565aeec65a89dd9d347d5730d5e84494f8535da6419cdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b7175909aee8ce03791965ee234bfe872f940b215b4506ec0f0b1e30d0cf99d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41989d666aefb3786ca9b5b949321066982ed454d3567c3bc79f01c213e1a860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337171a55b9c980d0dcb5ffb1bd97f2bfe3343740427c244b5a793ad0cef374b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c1e23a0ce98e3ab6be8fd0ba73ff8a04834563d3bc6b6a28016942800aea96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7efe0d6b67c1b39367c09aa93cf17410243ba43338b16f788915ff8afce12d2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84d7361cb1344ec6b34607e1ffa71f6fa5a0707b1c2af1350dabed4ef3eb78ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aafeb881cd23ba01cc9e7e2ac9636513df83f37fde9301fdf8943aadd66a1a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b906346eed7e4a224403e60ffc5f35f5ff18699d55120568924463cc31dd7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45e5ac6c7f9fe3736f2815b71cd467c73369fe987b9b7844edefe0f26772ebbc</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent is designated to administer the Agreement and act on behalf of the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for executing the Agreement and receiving counterparts from all parties."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent upholds the terms and conditions defined in the Agreement including managing the accounts and records."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Execution, Responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"contractual responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"management role"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-e40a6ce74fe978e7cab7bc4b2d776d5500985fc28b4f39192e445d1dae7277ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6b7cdf0d7ee80ebd481b61e63f9c51eb02289ce4b8ad902df17900f1154fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ce8a112ad9bc4f178c0e7682716633ad80585fa573f2db52e4399573e429b10</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-236032ad52b5c77d76ca8b5b9d3ee21fa9d36f49e15211204ee2de8f5df0e70a</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">180.0</data>
  <data key="d5">The Administrative Agent serves as a vital intermediary on behalf of the Lenders, facilitating and managing various administrative aspects related to the credit agreement. Primarily, the Administrative Agent is responsible for ensuring effective communication between the Lenders and the Borrower, thereby managing the flow of information and compliance with the terms of the credit facilities. This includes notifying the Lenders about critical developments such as any Benchmark Replacements, requests for Eurocurrency Loans, the issuance of Letters of Credit, and triggers for fallback from established indices like LIBOR, CDOR, or EURIBOR.

As a fiduciary, the Administrative Agent collects and distributes funds to the Lenders and oversees the operational management of the loan agreement. The responsibilities bestowed upon the Administrative Agent by the Lenders encompass managing payments related to the Borrower's advances, coordinating their interactions, and ensuring that all necessary communications and notices are effectively managed.

Furthermore, the Administrative Agent is authorized to handle the Cash Collateral account for the benefit of the Lenders and plays a key role in representing them in the administration of credit facilities and document procedures. The Administrative Agent is also involved in the process of appointing a successor in the event of the current Agent’s resignation or removal, emphasizing the collaborative relationship between the Lenders and the Administrative Agent in managing the intricacies of the credit agreement. Overall, the Lenders fundamentally rely on the Administrative Agent to effectively uphold their shared objectives and streamline the operational functions associated with the loan.</data>
