<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Issuing Lender is directly involved in providing Letters of Credit as sanctioned by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender is recognized among the Lenders in the context of providing credit to the Borrower, ensuring obligations are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender, as a part of the group of Lenders, is responsible for approving the issuance of Letters of Credit requested by the Borrower."}</data>
  <data key="d6">"approval"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaboration, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial entity"</data>
