  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is a party to the Agreement, which specifies the terms under which they will receive financing and repayment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is bound by the terms of the Agreement, which outlines their responsibilities, including repayment of loans and adherence to covenants."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to adhere to the terms outlined within the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is party to the Agreement, which outlines the terms under which they receive financing and their obligations to repay.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must perform its obligations strictly according to the terms of the Agreement regardless of circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide electronic signatures and may create records of Communications related to the Agreement."&lt;</data>
