<edge source="&quot;LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ISSUING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">64.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both entities operate under the same agreement and have roles in issuing and participating in letters of credit."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Both the Lender and Issuing Lender are entitled to seek compensation due to changes affecting their capital requirements under the agreement.";&lt;SEP&gt;"Both the Lender and Issuing Lender are involved in providing financing and letters of credit under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;"financing, letters of credit"&lt;SEP&gt;"Both the Lender and Issuing Lender work collaboratively concerning the financial transactions and documentation, sharing rights and obligations under the Loan Documents."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender issues payment instruments on behalf of the Lender under the terms defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Issuing Lender operates as a specific type of Lender that directly issues financial support to the Borrower for transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender and Issuing Lender work together to process transactions under the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;"collaboration"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender collaborates with the Issuing Lender to disburse and manage funds allocated for loan purposes as specified in the Loan Document."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender may issue financial instruments via the Issuing Lender to facilitate transactions on behalf of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between the Lender and Issuing Lender is characterized by BARCLAYS BANK PLC fulfilling both roles in the context of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compensation Under Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Issuing, Lending"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Distribution"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"issuance of financial instruments"&lt;SEP&gt;"issues"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;["dual role", "credit agreement", "financing"]&lt;SEP&gt;involvement, roles&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-80deda61594e7242d6d82b4a17cd4839b96e376b53056d05871a4b5c85f4f1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1fbadef1542fe6b85421b5736bdaa13e5a005ae9ae9a1ffea09a5d52c4d8121&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e62c5ad35244893d47c41c57cf2f91066b96affaf8d1e8160b7b82529c6a81d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7bcfa9fa46866ae989d6ffec4d2b588d2ffd7682df2a5996aaa115c66fcd595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8d33f29a840f4d84faed83a3c1e767c065efcb42c195f8b7fa8235336825d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b3831b5841bb69061b1fe0e6df962aef02a686803822e68bc9aff48fec74e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc3c63f017c57c99df34221b48c51e924cb393015709234b1ce975d2bb6bcba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5b1ddd76b46da4f5b285127348b0ac9622761aad50db0119a29e624efdf1ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d98031430f0b0255f48182995737acdd3844c6fd9557981e0e3bf24bdd46f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e290c93761fbccff21c271b66a77cdf6ae6c638e176225b143e913e3bb53382c</data>
